["22128778"],"journal":"Molecular Metabolism","paperid":"102190","status":"p","title":"Molecular Metabolism","volume":"94"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-105008984021"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Miscellaneous","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-OT","DI-OT-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Miscellaneous","Other Research","Universities","University of Copenhagen"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ku-13b8a8a5-5fa3-440f-aa3b-c9e0de01fe51"],"src":["KU University of Copenhagen"],"title":"Housing matters : Experimental variables shaping metabolism in obese mice","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-818566","year":"2025","yearsub":"2025"}
{"abstract":"Background: Survivors of hematopoietic stem cell transplantation (HSCT) during childhood face significant late effects. This study aimed to map the dietary micronutrient intake of long-term survivors of pediatric HSCT and explore its associations with transplant outcomes, body composition, and physical capacity. Methods: We included 85 long-term survivors of HSCT (median age 30 years) The median time since HSCT was 19.9 years, reflecting a long-term survivor population. Dietary intake was assessed using a 3-day food record. Body composition was measured by DXA, and physical capacity was evaluated through cardiorespiratory fitness and physical performance tests. Results: We observed an inadequate intake of several vitamins and minerals including vitamins A, C, D, E, selenium, and potassium, with a median intake below recommendations. While dietary intake of vitamin D was reduced in patients with chronic graft versus host disease (cGvHD), the occurrence of cGvHD was not associated with overall micronutrient intake. Twelve percent of the participants had reduced skeletal muscle mass and 16% displayed a low bone mass density during DXA scans. These conditions were not related to the micronutrient intake. Likewise, reduced cardiorespiratory fitness and physical performance were unrelated to micronutrient intake. Total energy intake was found to significantly influence micronutrient intake (p = 0.001), explaining 66% of the variation. Conclusions: Long-term survivors of pediatric HSCT demonstrated inadequate intake of multiple micronutrients. These findings suggest that inclusion of comprehensive micronutrient assessment and nutritional guidance should be considered for inclusion in follow-up care protocols.","author_count":9,"contributors":["Pedersen, Louise Lindkvist","Sørum, Maria Ebbesen","Nissen, Anne","Gerbek, Tina","Kok, Karin","Sorensen, Kaspar","Fridh, Martin Kaj","Mølgaard, Christian","Müller, Klaus"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-819329"],"filters":{"added":"2025-08","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Body composition","Late effects","Micronutrients","Nutrition","Pediatric hematopoietic stem cell transplantation","Physical performance"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-U"],"level3":{"HO":["DI-HO-ALL","DI-HO-CAP"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-HO-CAP","DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"dietary micronutrient intake in long term survivors of pediatric hematopoietic stem cell transplantation","src":["ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.3390/nu17101663","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-819329","identifier":[{"id":"001495651400001","type":"wos"},{"id":"105006452753","type":"scopus"},{"id":"40431403","type":"pmid"},{"id":"PMC12113892","type":"pmcid"}],"ids":["ku-6e56ad20-dbf4-43d3-8682-1527b08271ff"],"keyword":["Body composition","Late effects","Micronutrients","Nutrition","Pediatric hematopoietic stem cell transplantation","Physical performance"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-3-5E60B53E0F17FE439690144389A6F8F9"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"loc","url":"https://curis.ku.dk/ws/files/452015524/nutrients-17-01663-v2.pdf","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.3390/nu17101663","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"dk","key":"capital region of denmark","l2":"DI-HO","l2n":"Hospitals","l3":"DI-HO-CAP","l3nl":"Capital Region of Denmark","l3nn":"Capital Region of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Capital Region of Denmark","namevar":["Copenhagen University Hospital - Rigshospitalet"],"nora_code":"DI-HO-CAP","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Health and Medical Sciences, Department of Biomedical Sciences, Endocrinology and Metabolism"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","first":"Louise Lindkvist","key":"pedersenpau","last":"Pedersen","name":"Pedersen, Louise Lindkvist","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1 2","first":"Maria Ebbesen","key":"sorumpau","last":"Sorum","locid":"a8fd6137-ef56-4029-9379-26fcf48637fe","name":"Sørum, Maria Ebbesen","name_org":"Sorum, Maria Ebbesen","orcid":"0000-0002-3907-7916","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Anne","key":"nissenpau","last":"Nissen","name":"Nissen, Anne","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Tina","key":"gerbekpau","last":"Gerbek","name":"Gerbek, Tina","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Karin","key":"kokpau","last":"Kok","name":"Kok, Karin","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Kaspar","key":"sorensenpau","last":"Sorensen","name":"Sorensen, Kaspar","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Martin Kaj","key":"fridhpau","last":"Fridh","name":"Fridh, Martin Kaj","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1 2","first":"Christian","key":"molgaardpau","last":"Molgaard","locid":"240d0bd3-4221-4d27-bfdb-8fd6887cdb30","name":"Mølgaard, Christian","name_org":"Molgaard, Christian","orcid":"0000-0002-5311-9457","rank":8,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1 2","first":"Klaus Gottlob","key":"mullerpau","last":"Muller","locid":"b909f13e-79e3-4363-aaff-e5a5ecbdf7ce","name":"Müller, Klaus","name_org":"Muller, Klaus Gottlob","rank":9,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["40431403"],"pub":{"doi":"10.3390/nu17101663","issn":["20726643"],"issue":"10","journal":"Nutrients","paperid":"1663","status":"p","title":"Nutrients","volume":"17"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-105006452753"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Hospitals","All Universities","Capital Region of Denmark","DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-HO-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Hospitals","Universities","University of Copenhagen"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ku-6e56ad20-dbf4-43d3-8682-1527b08271ff"],"src":["KU University of Copenhagen"],"title":"Dietary Micronutrient Intake in Long-Term Survivors of Pediatric Hematopoietic Stem Cell Transplantation","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-819329","year":"2025","yearsub":"2025"}
{"abstract":"As Earth’s climate warms, surface melting of the Greenland Ice Sheet has intensified, increasing rates of sea-level rise. Observations and theory indicate that meltwater generated at the ice sheet surface can drain to its bed, where it flows relatively unhindered to the ocean. This understanding of water movement within and beneath ice sheets underpins the theoretical models that are used to make projections of ice sheet change. Here we present evidence of a destructive mode of meltwater drainage in Greenland. Using multiple satellite sources, we show that a 90-million-cubic-metre subglacial flood forced its way upwards from the bed, fracturing the ice sheet, and bursting through the surface. This phenomenon was triggered by the rapid drainage of a subglacial lake and occurred in a region where the ice bed was predicted to be frozen. The resulting flood caused a rapid deceleration of the downstream marine-terminating glacier. Our observations reveal a complex, bi-directional coupling between the ice sheet’s surface and basal hydrological systems and demonstrate that extreme hydrological forcing may occur in regions of predicted cold-based ice. Such processes can impact the ice sheet’s dynamics and structural integrity but are not currently considered in ice sheet models.","author_count":20,"contributors":["Bowling, Jade S.","McMillan, Malcolm","Leeson, Amber A.","Livingstone, Stephen J.","Sole, Andrew J.","Ng, Felix S.L.","Karlsson, Nanna B.","Nienow, Peter","Boxall, Karla","Noël, Brice","van den Broeke, Michiel R.","Slater, Thomas","Maddalena, Jennifer","Sørensen, Louise Sandberg","Simonsen, Sebastian Bjerregaard","Mouginot, Jérémie","Millan, Romain","Melling, Laura","Taylor, Liam","Humbert, Angelika"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-828065"],"filters":{"added":"2025-10","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Europe, EU","Europe, Non-EU","OECD"],"corresponding_author":["McMillan, Malcolm"],"country":["Belgium","France","Germany","Netherlands","United Kingdom"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Lancaster University","Northumbria University","University of Bremen","University of Edinburgh","University of Leeds","University of Liege","University of Sheffield","Université Grenoble Alpes","Utrecht University"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-GV","DI-U"],"level3":{"GV":["DI-GV-ALL","DI-GV-GEUS"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU"]},"level3all":["DI-GV-GEUS","DI-U-DTU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"outburst of a subglacial flood from the surface of the greenland ice sheet","src":["dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1038/s41561-025-01746-9","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-828065","identifier":[{"id":"105012312072","type":"scopus"},{"id":"PMC12331518","type":"pmcid"},{"id":"40787653","type":"pmid"}],"ids":["dtu-eb581c74-51fc-4884-89b1-a6fb6ad89d19"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-3-9A923CE0CE2DC456732D7B8D7BDB9702"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/409544043/s41561-025-01746-9-1.pdf","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1038/s41561-025-01746-9","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"gb","key":"lancaster university","loc":["United Kingdom","Europe, Non-EU","OECD"],"name":"Lancaster University","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"gb","key":"university of sheffield","loc":["United Kingdom","Europe, Non-EU","OECD"],"name":"University of Sheffield","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"dk","key":"geus geological survey of denmark and greenland","l2":"DI-GV","l2n":"Governmental Institutions","l3":"DI-GV-GEUS","l3nn":"GEUS Geological Survey of Denmark and Greenland","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"GEUS Geological Survey of Denmark and Greenland","namevar":["Geological Survey of Denmark and Greenland"],"nora_code":"DI-GV-GEUS","used":1},{"affno":"4","country":"gb","key":"university of edinburgh","loc":["United Kingdom","Europe, Non-EU","OECD"],"name":"University of Edinburgh","used":1},{"affno":"5","country":"be","key":"university of liege","loc":["Belgium","Europe, EU","OECD"],"name":"University of Liege","used":1},{"affno":"6","country":"nl","key":"utrecht university","loc":["Netherlands","Europe, EU","OECD"],"name":"Utrecht University","used":1},{"affno":"7","country":"gb","key":"northumbria university","loc":["United Kingdom","Europe, Non-EU","OECD"],"name":"Northumbria University","used":1},{"affno":"8","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark, Department of Space Research and Technology","Technical University of Denmark, Department of Space Research and Technology, Geodesy and Earth Observation"],"nora_code":"DI-U-DTU","used":1},{"affno":"9","country":"fr","key":"université grenoble alpes","loc":["France","Europe, EU","OECD"],"name":"Université Grenoble Alpes","used":1},{"affno":"10","country":"gb","key":"university of leeds","loc":["United Kingdom","Europe, Non-EU","OECD"],"name":"University of Leeds","used":1},{"affno":"11","country":"de","key":"university of bremen","loc":["Germany","Europe, EU","OECD"],"name":"University of Bremen","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Jade S.","key":"bowlingpau","last":"Bowling","name":"Bowling, Jade S.","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Malcolm","key":"mcmillanpau","last":"McMillan","name":"McMillan, Malcolm","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"af