","publisher":"BioMed Central","status":"p","title":"BMC Pregnancy and Childbirth","volume":"24"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85195533461"],"search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-82543879-3ae3-4286-94f2-099a43e7216d"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University"],"title":"A comparison of the breast milk microbiota from women diagnosed with gestational diabetes mellitus and women without gestational diabetes mellitus","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-742970","year":"2024","yearsub":"2024"}
{"abstract":"Background: Breast cancer-related lymphedema (BRCL) is one of the most common causes of upper extremity (UE) lymphedema in developed nations and substantially impacts health-related quality of life. To advance our understanding of the epidemiology and treatment of BRCL, rigorously developed and validated patient-reported outcome measures (PROMs) are needed. This study aimed to demonstrate the iterative content validity of a modular UE lymphedema-specific PROM called the LYMPH-Q UE module. Methods: A multi-step iterative qualitative approach was used. Semi-structured interview data from in-depth qualitative interviews with adult women (18 years and older) with BCRL were used to develop the first set of the LYMPH-Q UE scales. The content validity of these scales was demonstrated with patient and clinician feedback. Over the course of cognitive debriefing interviews, additional concepts of lymphedema worry and impact on work were identified as missing from the LYMPH-Q UE module. Subsequently, two new qualitative studies (a focus group and in-depth concept elicitation interviews with patients) were conducted, and two new scales were developed to measure lymphedema worry and impact on work life and their content validity was demonstrated. Results: Qualitative data from in-depth and cognitive interviews with 15 (age 40–74 years) and 16 (age 38–74 years) women with BRCL, respectively, and feedback from 12 clinical experts, were used to develop and demonstrate the content validity of six LYMPH-Q UE scales measuring symptoms, function, appearance, psychological, information, and arm sleeve. Additionally, data from in-depth interviews with 12 (age 35–72 years) women with UE lymphedema and four focus groups (n = 16 women; age 35–74 years) was used to develop and assess the content validity of two new LYMPH-Q UE scales measuring lymphedema worry and impact on work life. The content validity of the previously established six scales was also demonstrated in these subsequent qualitative studies. Conclusion: The LYMPH-Q UE is a modular PROM developed using international guidelines for PROM development and can be used in clinical practice, research, and quality improvement to enhance patient-centered shared decision-making. This study’s innovative and iterative approach to content validation demonstrates that the LYMPH-Q UE is a comprehensive measure that includes important concepts relevant to patients with UE lymphedema.","author_count":13,"contributors":["Kaur, Manraj N.","Cornacchi, Sylvie D.","Tsangaris, Elena","Poulsen, Lotte","Beelen, Louise M.","Bordeleau, Louise","Zhong, Toni","Jørgensen, Mads Gustaf","Sørensen, Jens Ahm","Mehrara, Babak","Dayan, Joseph","Pusic, Andrea L.","Klassen, Anne F."],"cuid":["S01-000.00-750351"],"filters":{"added":"2024-08","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["America, North","Europe, EU","OECD"],"corresponding_author":["Kaur, Manraj N."],"country":["Canada","Netherlands","United States"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Erasmus University Medical Center Rotterdam","Harvard Medical School","Juranvinski Cancer Center","McMaster University","Memorial Sloan-Kettering Cancer Center","Modus Outcomes","Toronto General Hospital"],"keyword":["Adult","Aged","Breast Cancer Lymphedema therapy","Breast Neoplasms complications","Breast cancer related lymphedema","Female","Focus Groups","Humans","Interviews as Topic","Lymphedema","Middle Aged","Patient Reported Outcome Measures","Patient reported outcome measure","Patient reported outcomes","Psychometrics methods","Qualitative Research","Quality of Life psychology","Reproducibility of Results","Upper Extremity physiopathology"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"iterative qualitative approach to establishing content validation of a patient reported outcome measure for arm lymphedema the lymph q upper extremity module","src":["sdu"],"src-code":["DI-U-SDU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1186/s41687-024-00701-3","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-750351","identifier":[{"id":"PMC11208340","type":"pmcid"},{"id":"38922461","type":"pmid"},{"id":"85196870381","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["sdu-3cad2450-c035-4dad-9977-a73dc3c660b6"],"keyword":["Adult","Aged","Arm swelling","Breast Cancer Lymphedema/therapy","Breast Neoplasms/complications","Breast cancer-related lymphedema","Female","Focus Groups","Humans","Interviews as Topic","Lymphedema","Lymphedema/psychology","Middle Aged","Patient Reported Outcome Measures","Patient-reported outcome measure","Patient-reported outcomes","Psychometrics/methods","Qualitative Research","Quality of Life/psychology","Reproducibility of Results","Upper Extremity/physiopathology"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-FFB0806206012134EE2E1C4429EE97F4"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1186/s41687-024-00701-3","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"loc","url":"https://findresearcher.sdu.dk/ws/files/265931650/s41687-024-00701-3_1_.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"us","key":"harvard medical school","loc":["United States","America, North","OECD"],"name":"Harvard Medical School","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"ca","key":"mcmaster university","loc":["Canada","America, North","OECD"],"name":"McMaster University","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"us","key":"modus outcomes","loc":["United States","America, North","OECD"],"name":"Modus Outcomes","used":1},{"affno":"4","key":"sdu university of southern denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-SDU","l3nl":"University of Southern Denmark","l3nn":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","namevar":["SDU, The Faculty of Health Sciences, Department of Clinical Research","SDU, The Faculty of Health Sciences, Department of Clinical Research, KI, OUH, Research unit of Plastic Surgery (Odense)"],"nora_code":"DI-U-SDU","used":1},{"affno":"5","country":"nl","key":"erasmus university medical center rotterdam","loc":["Netherlands","Europe, EU","OECD"],"name":"Erasmus University Medical Center Rotterdam","used":1},{"affno":"6","country":"ca","key":"juranvinski cancer center","loc":["Canada","America, North","OECD"],"name":"Juranvinski Cancer Center","used":1},{"affno":"7","country":"ca","key":"toronto general hospital","loc":["Canada","America, North","OECD"],"name":"Toronto General Hospital","used":1},{"affno":"8","country":"us","key":"memorial sloan kettering cancer center","loc":["United States","America, North","OECD"],"name":"Memorial Sloan-Kettering Cancer Center","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Manraj N.","key":"kaurpau","last":"Kaur","name":"Kaur, Manraj N.","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Sylvie D.","key":"cornacchipau","last":"Cornacchi","name":"Cornacchi, Sylvie D.","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","corresponding":null,"first":"Elena","key":"tsangarispau","last":"Tsangaris","name":"Tsangaris, Elena","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"4","corresponding":null,"first":"Lotte","key":"poulsenpau","last":"Poulsen","locid":"50183c95-07ae-4fc6-9434-83888b3b60a3","name":"Poulsen, Lotte","orcid":"0000-0003-4205-806X","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"5","corresponding":null,"first":"Louise M.","key":"beelenpau","last":"Beelen","name":"Beelen, Louise M.","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"6","corresponding":null,"first":"Louise","key":"bordeleaupau","last":"Bordeleau","name":"Bordeleau, Louise","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"7","corresponding":null,"first":"Toni","key":"zhongpau","last":"Zhong","name":"Zhong, Toni","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"4","corresponding":null,"first":"Mads Gustaf","key":"jorgensenpau","last":"Jorgensen","locid":"aebe7465-c8a9-452a-9b45-6259e674c2ee","name":"Jørgensen, Mads Gustaf","name_org":"Jorgensen, Mads Gustaf","orcid":"0000-0002-8755-3446","rank":8,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"4","corresponding":null,"first":"Jens Ahm","key":"sorensenpau","last":"Sorensen","locid":"267cd59a-3918-47db-8d23-54015d770b6c","name":"Sørensen, Jens Ahm","name_org":"Sorensen, Jens Ahm","orcid":"0000-0003-4903-0094","rank":9,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"8","corresponding":null,"first":"Babak","key":"mehrarapau","last":"Mehrara","name":"Mehrara, Babak","rank":10,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"8","corresponding":null,"first":"Joseph","key":"dayanpau","last":"Dayan","name":"Dayan, Joseph","rank":11,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Andrea L.","key":"pusicpau","last":"Pusic","name":"Pusic, Andrea L.","rank":12,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Anne F.","key":"klassenpau","last":"Klassen","name":"Klassen, Anne F.","rank":13,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["38922461"],"pub":{"doi":"10.1186/s41687-024-00701-3","issn":["25098020"],"journal":"Journal of Patient-Reported Outcomes","paperid":"63","publisher":"Springer","status":"p","title":"Journal of Patient-Reported Outcomes","volume":"8"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85196870381"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities","University of Southern Denmark"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["sdu-3cad2450-c035-4dad-9977-a73dc3c660b6"],"src":["SDU University of Southern Denmark"],"title":"Iterative qualitative approach to establishing content validation of a patient-reported outcome measure for arm lymphedema : the LYMPH-Q Upper Extremity Module","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-750351","year":"2024","yearsub":"2024"}
{"abstract":"Surface topography across the marginal zone of the Greenland Ice Sheet is constantly evolving in response to changing weather, season, climate, and ice dynamics. However, current digital elevation models (DEMs) for the ice sheet are usually based on data from a multi-year period, thus obscuring these changes over time. Here we present four 500 m resolution summer DEMs (PRODEMs) of the Greenland Ice Sheet marginal zone for 2019 through 2022. The PRODEMs cover the marginal zone from the ice edge to 50 km inland, hence capturing all Greenland outlet glaciers. Each PRODEM is based on data fusion of CryoSat-2 radar altimetry and ICESat-2 laser altimetry using regionally varying kriging of elevation anomalies relative to ArcticDEM. The PRODEMs are validated using leave-one-out cross-validation, and PRODEM19 is further validated against an external data set, showcasing their ability to correctly represent surface elevations within the associated spatially varying prediction uncertainties. We observe a general lowering of surface elevations during the 4-year PRODEM period, but the spatial pattern of change is highly complex and with annual changes superimposed. The PRODEMs enable detailed studies of the marginal ice sheet elevation changes. With their high spatio-temporal resolution, the PRODEMs will be of value to a wide range of researchers and users studying ice sheet dynamics and monitoring how the ice sheet responds to changing environmental conditions. PRODEMs from summer 2019 through 2022 are available at 10.22008/FK2/52WWHG (Winstrup, 2024), and we plan to annually update the product henceforth.","author_count":7,"contributors":["Winstrup, Mai","Villadsen, Heidi","Hillerup Larsen, Signe","Simonsen, Sebastian Bjerregaard","Mankoff, Kenneth D.","Fausto, Robert S.","Sørensen, Louise Sandberg"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-775960"],"filters":{"added":"2025-01","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["America, North","OECD"],"corresponding_author":["Winstrup, Mai"],"country":["United States"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","NASA Goddard Institute for Space Studies"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-GV","DI-U"],"level3":{"GV":["DI-GV-ALL","DI-GV-GEUS"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU"]},"level3all":["DI-GV-GEUS","DI-U-DTU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"prodem an annual series of summer dems 000000002019 through 000000002022 of the marginal areas of the greenland ice sheet","src":["dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.5194/essd-16-5405-2024","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-775960","identifier":[{"id":"85210901738","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["dtu-bbc2f02a-5ce2-4024-b27c-da61af1e1aba"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-70AB9F2D5802FE49995551E3F3E9BF0A"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.5194/essd-16-5405-2024","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/383630062/essd-16-5405-2024.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark, Department of Space Research and Technology","Technical University of Denmark, Department of Space Research and Technology, Geodesy and Earth Observation"],"nora_code":"DI-U-DTU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","key":"geus geological survey of denmark and greenland","l2":"DI-GV","l2n":"Governmental Institutions","l3":"DI-GV-GEUS","l3nn":"GEUS Geological Survey of Denmark and Greenland","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"GEUS Geological Survey of Denmark and Greenland","namevar":["Geological Survey of Denmark and Greenland"],"nora_code":"DI-GV-GEUS","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"us","key":"nasa goddard institute for space studies","loc":["United States","America, North","OECD"],"name":"NASA Goddard Institute for Space Studies","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Mai","key":"winstruppau","last":"Winstrup","locid":"5b8bc307-4b30-4668-9e2c-646716b77fcd","name":"Winstrup, Mai","orcid":"0000-0002-4794-4004","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Heidi","key":"ranndalpau","last":"Ranndal","locid":"bbdd6573-9fb4-4328-8775-4fbf7336aa34","name":"Villadsen, Heidi","name_org":"Ranndal, Heidi","orcid":"0000-0002-0503-5048","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Signe","key":"hilleruplarsenpau","last":"Hillerup Larsen","name":"Hillerup Larsen, Signe","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Sebastian B.","key":"simonsenpau","last":"Simonsen","locid":"d088b945-224e-4fd3-a871-022cc71c5cb1","name":"Simonsen, Sebastian Bjerregaard","name_org":"Simonsen, Sebastian B.","orcid":"0000-0001-9569-1294","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","corresponding":null,"first":"Kenneth D.","key":"mankoffpau","last":"Mankoff","name":"Mankoff, Kenneth D.","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Robert S.","key":"faustopau","last":"Fausto","name":"Fausto, Robert S.","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Louise","key":"sandbergsørensenpau","last":"Sandberg Sørensen","locid":"1c6cb90f-da30-48a2-872f-a94b8100749b","name":"Sørensen, Louise Sandberg","name_org":"Sandberg Sørensen, Louise","orcid":"0000-0002-3771-4061","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.5194/essd-16-5405-2024","issn":["18663508","18663516"],"