rst":"Joachim Hjalde Halmsted","key":"olsenpau","last":"Olsen","name":"Olsen, Joachim Hjalde Halmsted","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1 2","first":"Line","key":"schmidtpau","last":"Schmidt","locid":"f91dfc8e-a938-4086-a410-f74e9c2e7851","name":"Schmidt, L.","name_org":"Schmidt, Line","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Rasmus","key":"alderpau","last":"Alder","name":"Alder, Rasmus","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Sara Gamborg","key":"sørensenpau","last":"Sørensen","name":"Sørensen, Sara Gamborg","rank":8,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Sengül","key":"gülenpau","last":"Gülen","name":"Gülen, Sengül","rank":9,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1 2","first":"Louise Laurberg","key":"klarskovpau","last":"Klarskov","locid":"fd090189-4b0e-4a30-9734-7c3795539f2b","name":"Klarskov, Louise Laurberg","rank":10,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3 4","country":"dk","first":"Karen Angeliki","key":"krogfeltpau","last":"Krogfelt","locid":"8adea330-733a-4bc4-8bdd-b4aa97fe4530","name":"Krogfelt, Karen Angeliki","orcid":"0000-0001-7536-3453","rank":11,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2 1","first":"Henrik","key":"westhpau","last":"Westh","locid":"5ed71556-672c-4f57-95de-3abba6b821ea","name":"Westh, Henrik","rank":12,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1 2","first":"Jacob","key":"rosenbergpau","last":"Rosenberg","locid":"00b94c43-5ffb-4e1e-ac75-320aa0c79745","name":"Rosenberg, Jacob","rank":13,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["36932839"],"pub":{"doi":"10.1111/apm.13311","issn":["09034641","0903465X"],"issn_org":["09034641"],"issue":"6","journal":"APMIS","pages":"284-293","status":"p","title":"APMIS","volume":"131"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85151462435"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Governmental Institutions","All Hospitals","All Universities","Capital Region of Denmark","DI-ALL","DI-GV","DI-GV-ALL","DI-HO","DI-HO-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Governmental Institutions","Hospitals","Roskilde University","Universities","University of Copenhagen"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ku-9fde2767-0646-4eed-a58e-9663de166b2d","ruc-6880990a-01e9-44d7-b26b-1a81c4b392f7"],"src":["KU University of Copenhagen","RUC Roskilde University"],"title":"Diarrhoea-causing microorganisms are rare in adult patients undergoing diagnostic laparoscopy for suspected appendicitis : a prospective observational cohort study","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S02-089.47-681575","year":"2023","yearsub":"2023"}
{"abstract":"Background: Roflumilast is a targeted inhibitor of phosphodiesterase (PDE)-4 and has been approved for treatment of severe chronic obstructive pulmonary disease for more than a decade. Generic versions are available in the United States. PDE-4 is involved in the psoriasis pathogenesis, but the efficacy and safety of oral roflumilast in patients with psoriasis have not previously been studied. Methods: A company-independent, multicenter, randomized, double-blind, placebo-controlled trial (ClinicalTrials.gov NCT04549870). Patients were randomized 1:1 to receive monotherapy with oral roflumilast 500 μg once daily or placebo. At week 12, placebo patients were switched to open-label roflumilast through week 24. The primary endpoint was a 75% or greater reduction from baseline in the psoriasis area and severity index (PASI75) at week 12. Findings: In all, 46 patients were randomized (roflumilast, n = 23; placebo, n = 23). At week 12, significantly more patients in the active arm achieved PASI75 (8 of 23 patients [35%]) vs. placebo (0 of 23 patients [0%], with a difference vs. placebo of 8 [35%] patients, 95% CI: 3 [13%]—13 [57%] patients) (p = 0.014). At week 24, 15 (65%), 10 (44%), 5 (22%), and 2 (9%) of patients treated with roflumilast from week 0 had PASI50, PASI75, PASI90, and PASI100 responses (key secondary endpoints), respectively. The most prevalent, drug-related adverse events in both treatment groups were transient gastrointestinal symptoms, weight-loss, headache, and insomnia. A total of three patients (roflumilast n = 2; placebo, n = 1) discontinued therapy due to adverse events. Interpretation: Oral roflumilast was efficacious and safe in treating moderate-to-severe plaque psoriasis over 24 weeks. With generic versions available, this drug may represent an inexpensive and convenient alternative to established systemic psoriasis treatments. Funding: Financial support was received from Herlev and Gentofte Hospital, University of Copenhagen, and independent grants from private foundations in Denmark. No pharmaceutical company, including the market authorization holder of roflumilast, was involved in the study at any point.","author_count":14,"contributors":["Gyldenløve, Mette","Meteran, Howraman","Sørensen, Jennifer A.","Fage, Simon","Yao, Yiqiu","Lindhardsen, Jesper","Nissen, Christoffer V.","Todberg, Tanja","Thomsen, Simon F.","Skov, Lone","Zachariae, Claus","Iversen, Lars","Nielsen, Mia Louise","Egeberg, Alexander"],"cuid":["S02-099.86-724871"],"filters":{"added":"2023-06","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"corresponding_author":["Egeberg, Alexander"],"keyword":["COPD","Chronic obstructive pulmonary disease","PDE4 inhibitor","Phosphodiesterase 4","Psoriasis","Roflumilast","Therapy"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-U"],"level3":{"HO":["DI-HO-ALL","DI-HO-CAP","DI-HO-CDR"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-HO-CAP","DI-HO-CDR","DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"efficacy and safety of oral roflumilast for moderate to severe psoriasis a randomized controlled trial psorro","src":["au","ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY-NC-ND","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.lanepe.2023.100639","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S02-099.86-724871","identifier":[{"id":"37465323","type":"pmid"},{"id":"85153078697","type":"scopus"},{"id":"PMC10350848","type":"pmcid"}],"ids":["au-d1ef277d-da01-4d7a-b5a8-03147158046b","ku-6a1c7f58-0a14-4592-b5ef-ebb1f6494065"],"keyword":["COPD","Chronic obstructive pulmonary disease","PDE4-inhibitor","Phosphodiesterase-4","Psoriasis","Roflumilast","Therapy"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-5-B6CD619BD50123A96FC0DAAA051E2F10"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY-NC-ND","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.lanepe.2023.100639","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY-NC-ND","type":"loc","url":"https://curis.ku.dk/ws/files/386606077/1_s2.0_S2666776223000583_main.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Health and Medical Sciences, Department of Clinical Medicine, Department of Clinical Medicine","Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Health and Medical Sciences, Department of Clinical Medicine, Dermatovenerology"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","key":"capital region of denmark","l2":"DI-HO","l2n":"Hospitals","l3":"DI-HO-CAP","l3nl":"Capital Region of Denmark","l3nn":"Capital Region of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Capital Region of Denmark","namevar":["Copenhagen University Hospital - Herlev and Gentofte"],"nora_code":"DI-HO-CAP","used":1},{"affno":"3","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Health, Department of Clinical Medicine, Department of Clinical Medicine - The Department of Dermatology and Venereology"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1},{"affno":"4","country":"dk","key":"central denmark region","l2":"DI-HO","l2n":"Hospitals","l3":"DI-HO-CDR","l3nl":"Central Denmark Region","l3nn":"Central Denmark Region","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Central Denmark Region","namevar":["Aarhus University Hospital"],"nora_code":"DI-HO-CDR","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1 2","first":"Mette","key":"gyldenløvepau","last":"Gylden