{"abstract":"Patients with chronic kidney disease undergoing hemodialysis generally have a significant symptom burden, which may interfere with their quality of life. The aim of this study was to identify the prevalence of fatigue, pain, anxiety, and depression in patients on hemodialysis and analyze their co-occurrence. A cross-sectional study used self-reported measures. A total of 242 patients aged 18 years or older were initially screened; 141 were included in the study; 129 answered the questionnaires (response rate 91%). Preva lences were 24.8% had moderate to severe fatigue, 38.0% had pain, 32.6% had anxiety, and 29.5% had depression. The prevalence of coexistent moderate to severe symptoms ranged from 15.5% to 25.6%. Further research is needed to better understand the symptom burden and their co-occurrence in patients receiving hemodialysis.","author_count":9,"contributors":["Lykke, Camilla","Sørensen, Jonas","Liem, Ylian S.","Eidemak, Inge","Larsen, Sille","Sjøgren, Per","Molsted, Stig","Laursen, Louise","Kurita, Geana Paula"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-719087"],"filters":{"added":"2024-02","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Anxiety","Depression","Fatigue","Hemodialysis","Pain","Palliative care","Symptoms"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-U"],"level3":{"HO":["DI-HO-ALL","DI-HO-CAP"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-HO-CAP","DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"co occurrence of prevalent symptoms in patients receiving hemodialysis a cross sectional survey","src":["ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-719087","identifier":[{"id":"85180419613","type":"scopus"},{"id":"38112678","type":"pmid"}],"ids":["ku-010f4ea6-3124-4d76-bc17-db5e2c9aad4f"],"keyword":["anxiety","depression","fatigue","hemodialysis","pain","palliative care","symptoms"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-FDE47ECB938640CD8EEE4E931CB56B91"],"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"dk","key":"capital region of denmark","l2":"DI-HO","l2n":"Hospitals","l3":"DI-HO-CAP","l3nl":"Capital Region of Denmark","l3nn":"Capital Region of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Capital Region of Denmark","namevar":["Copenhagen University Hospital - Rigshospitalet","Copenhagen University Hospital – North Zealand"],"nora_code":"DI-HO-CAP","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Health and Medical Sciences, Department of Clinical Medicine, Department of Clinical Medicine","Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Health and Medical Sciences, Department of Clinical Medicine, Internal Medicine: Nephrology","Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Health and Medical Sciences, Department of Clinical Medicine, No speciality"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","first":"Camilla","key":"lykkepau","last":"Lykke","name":"Lykke, Camilla","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Jonas","key":"sørensenpau","last":"Sørensen","name":"Sørensen, Jonas","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Ylian S.","key":"liempau","last":"Liem","name":"Liem, Ylian S.","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Inge","key":"eidemakpau","last":"Eidemak","name":"Eidemak, Inge","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Sille","key":"larsenpau","last":"Larsen","name":"Larsen, Sille","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Per","key":"sjøgrenpau","last":"Sjøgren","name":"Sjøgren, Per","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1 2","first":"Stig","key":"molstedpau","last":"Molsted","locid":"05ca8142-78a6-4564-8d6f-ac2e4a5fb9b6","name":"Molsted, Stig","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Louise","key":"laursenpau","last":"Laursen","name":"Laursen, Louise","rank":8,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1 2","first":"Geana P.","key":"kuritapau","last":"Kurita","locid":"479b54ae-f26a-4027-b797-403bcf437ce5","name":"Kurita, Geana Paula","name_org":"Kurita, Geana P.","rank":9,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["38112678"],"pub":{"doi":"10.37526/1526-744x.2023.50.6.497","issn":["1526744X"],"issue":"6","journal":"Nephrology nursing journal : journal of the American Nephrology Nurses' Association","pages":"497-504","status":"p","title":"Nephrology nursing journal : journal of the American Nephrology Nurses' Association","volume":"50"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85180419613"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Hospitals","All Universities","Capital Region of Denmark","DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-HO-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Hospitals","Universities","University of Copenhagen"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ku-010f4ea6-3124-4d76-bc17-db5e2c9aad4f"],"src":["KU University of Copenhagen"],"title":"Co-Occurrence of Prevalent Symptoms in Patients Receiving Hemodialysis : A Cross-Sectional Survey","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-719087","year":"2023","yearsub":"2023"}
{"abstract":"Aim: We investigated the effect of 52-week treatment with liraglutide, a glucagon-like peptide 1 receptor agonist, on glucose tolerance and incretin effect in women with previous gestational diabetes mellitus (pGDM). Materials and Methods: Women with overweight/obesity and pGDM were randomized to once daily subcutaneous liraglutide 1.8 mg or placebo for 52 weeks. Participants underwent oral glucose tolerance test (OGTT) and isoglycaemic intravenous glucose infusion at baseline and at 52 weeks, and an additional OGTT after the drug wash-out. Results: In total, 104 women [age: mean ± SD, 38 ± 5 years; fasting plasma glucose (FPG): 5.5 ± 0.4 mmol/L; glycated haemoglobin (HbA1c): 33 ± 4 mmol/mol, bodyweight: 88.2 ± 14.8 kg, body mass index: 31.1 ± 4.3 kg/m2] were assigned to liraglutide (n = 49) or placebo (n = 55). Estimated treatment difference (ETD) for area under curve during OGTT was −173 (95% confidence interval −250 to −97) mmol/L × min, p <.0001, but after wash-out the difference disappeared [ETD 58 (−30 to 146) mmol/L × min, p =.536]. Liraglutide reduced FPG [ETD −0.2 (−0.4 to −0.1) mmol/L, p =.018], HbA1c [−2.2 (−3.5 to −0.8) mmol/mol, p =.018] and bodyweight [−3.9 (−6.2 to −1.6) kg, p =.012]. No change in the incretin effect was observed. The number of women with prediabetes was reduced from 64% to 10% with liraglutide vs. 50% with placebo [adjusted odds ratio 0.10 (0.03-0.32), p =.002]. Conclusions: Treatment with liraglutide for 52 weeks improved glucose tolerance, FPG, HbA1c and bodyweight in women with overweight/obesity and pGDM. Progression to prediabetes while on drug was markedly reduced, but after a 1-week drug wash-out, the effect was lost.","author_count":14,"contributors":["Foghsgaard, Signe","Vedtofte, Louise","Andersen, Emilie S.","Bahne, Emilie","Andreasen, Camilla","Sørensen, Anne Lyngholm","Forman, Julie Lyng","Mathiesen, Elisabeth R.","Svare, Jens A.","Clausen, Tine Dalsgaard","Damm, Peter","Holst, Jens Juul","Knop, Filip K.","Vilsbøll, Tina"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-719274"],"filters":{"added":"2024-02","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Clinical trial","GLP 1","GLP 1 analogue","Incretin therapy","Liraglutide"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-OT","DI-U"],"level3":{"HO":["DI-HO-ALL","DI-HO-CAP"],"OT":["Steno Diabetes Centre, Gentofte, Denmark."],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-HO-CAP","DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"liraglutide treatment for the prevention of glucose tolerance deterioration in women with prior gestational diabetes mellitus a 000000000052 week randomized controlled clinical trial","src":["ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-719274","identifier":[{"id":"37846555","type":"pmid"},{"id":"85174239831","type":"scopus"},{"id":"001086782500001","type":"wos"}],"ids":["ku-0de20349-9817-4e24-a8b7-ba60590a291c"],"keyword":["GLP-1","GLP-1 analogue","clinical trial","incretin therapy","liraglutide"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-1794E85A6A9D5D41C92C304E63671F5F"],"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"dk","key":"capital region of denmark","l2":"DI-HO","l2n":"Hospitals","l3":"DI-HO-CAP","l3nl":"Capital Region of Denmark","l3nn":"Capital Region of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Capital Region of Denmark","namevar":["Copenhagen University Hospital - Herlev and Gentofte"],"nora_code":"DI-HO-CAP","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","key":"miscellaneous","l2":"DI-OT","l2n":"Miscellaneous","l3":"DI-OT","l3nl":"Other Research","l3nn":"Miscellaneous","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Miscellaneous","namevar":["Steno Diabetes Centre, Gentofte, Denmark."],"nora_code":"DI-OT","used":1},{"affno":"3","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Health and Medical Sciences, Department of Public Health, Section of Biostatistics"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1 2","first":"Signe","key":"foghsgaardpau","last":"Foghsgaard","name":"Foghsgaard, Signe","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1 2","first":"Louise","key":"vedtoftepau","last":"Vedtofte","name":"Vedtofte, Louise","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1 2","first":"Emilie S.","key":"andersenpau","last":"Andersen","name":"Andersen, Emilie S.","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1 2","first":"Emilie","key":"bahnepau","last":"Bahne","name":"Bahne, Emilie","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1 2","first":"Camilla","key":"andreasenpau","last":"Andreasen","name":"Andreasen, Camilla","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","first":"Anne L.","key":"sørensenpau","last":"Sørensen","locid":"c72b99a4-378e-4646-9dcf-2d719872c079","name":"Sørensen, Anne Lyngholm","name_org":"Sørensen, Anne L.","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","first":"Julie L.","key":"formanpau","last":"Forman","locid":"ddfe2814-4ae0-463d-9748-c1ba0647b469","name":"Forman, Julie Lyng","name_org":"Forman, Julie L.","orcid":"0000-0001-7368-0869","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","first":"Elisabeth R.","key":"mathiesenpau","last":"Mathiesen","locid":"3acd58f4-6d64-4a89-a406-d2f43b310500","name":"Mathiesen, Elisabeth R.","rank":8,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Jens A.","key":"svarepau","last":"Svare","name":"Svare, Jens A.","rank":9,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","first":"Tine D.","key":"clausenpau","last":"Clausen","locid":"047e6356-0a01-48a6-9a2e-fa550c06183e","name":"Clausen, Tine Dalsgaard","name_org":"Clausen, Tine D.","rank":10,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","first":"Peter","key":"dammpau","last":"Damm","locid":"884d03d5-5981-4d33-80c6-adb21f836deb","name":"Damm, Peter","rank":11,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","first":"Jens J.","key":"holstpau","last":"Holst","locid":"864b6401-9024-4773-9bdb-f4d4ca57dcad","name":"Holst, Jens Juul","name_org":"Holst, Jens J.","orcid":"0000-0001-6853-3805","rank":12,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","first":"Filip K.","key":"knoppau","last":"Knop","locid":"ce6eaad9-59f8-4ecf-8a1e-388a74734f6a","name":"Knop, Filip K.","rank":13,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","first":"Tina","key":"vilsbøllpau","last":"Vilsbøll","locid":"76773372-af8c-45a0-9447-a509cbf6d466","name":"Vilsbøll, Tina","orcid":"0000-0002-0456-6787","rank":14,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["37846555"],"pub":{"doi":"10.1111/dom.15306","issn":["14628902","14631326"],"issn_org":["14628902"],"issue":"1","journal":"Diabetes, Obesity and Metabolism","pages":"201-214","status":"p","title":"Diabetes, Obesity and Metabolism","volume":"26"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85174239831"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Hospitals","All Miscellaneous","All Universities","Capital Region of Denmark","DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-HO-ALL","DI-OT","DI-OT-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Hospitals","Miscellaneous","Other Research","Universities","University of Copenhagen"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ku-0de20349-9817-4e24-a8b7-ba60590a291c"],"src":["KU University of Copenhagen"],"title":"Liraglutide treatment for the prevention of glucose tolerance deterioration in women with prior gestational diabetes mellitus : A 52-week randomized controlled clinical trial","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-719274","year":"2023","yearsub":"2023"}
