{"abstract":"Formålet med grønbogen er at skabe et fælles grundlag for det videre arbejde med at fremme naturen som ressource i sundhedsindsatserne i Danmark og dermed skabe et afsæt for en videreudvikling og et kvalitetsløft af disse indsatser","author_count":6,"contributors":["Poulsen, Dorthe Varning","Madsen, Louise Sofia","Sørensen, Tine Bordoff","Vibholm, Pernille","Mygind, Ole","Maribo, Thomas"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-679181"],"filters":{"added":"2023-07","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Det Natur og Biovidenskabelige Fakultet"],"level":"pop","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-OT","DI-U","DI-UC"],"level3":{"HO":["DI-HO-ALL","DI-HO-CDR"],"OT":["Marselisborg Centret, Region Midtjylland."],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"],"UC":["DI-UC-ALL","DI-UC-VIA"]},"level3all":["DI-HO-CDR","DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU","DI-UC-VIA"]},"review":"und","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"vi skal mere ud grønbog om naturen som ressource i sundhedsindsatser","src":["ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU"],"type":"db","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://curis.ku.dk/ws/files/356900702/VI_SKAL_MERE_UD_Gr_nbog_om_naturen_som_ressource_i_sundhedsindsatser.pdf","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-679181","ids":["ku-d1c26480-8e10-41f2-805c-17d79e6da982"],"keyword":["Det Natur- og Biovidenskabelige Fakultet"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Popular","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-A0C1565B3B978C6D73371B7FDC7EA5CD"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"https://www.rehabiliteringsforum.dk/siteassets/publikationerlitteratur/gronbog---web.pdf","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://curis.ku.dk/ws/files/356900702/VI_SKAL_MERE_UD_Gr_nbog_om_naturen_som_ressource_i_sundhedsindsatser.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Univer