{"abstract":"Based on developing, implementing, and evaluating postgraduate interprofessional case-based learning, we have written these twelve tips for health education planners who wish to apply case-based learning in the clinical setting. Interprofessional case-based learning engages participants in a structured manner towards uncovering decisions processes and patterns of action that resemble the clinical reality in which various healthcare professionals handle multifaceted tasks related to the optimal patient treatment. Postgraduate interprofessional case-based learning has the potential to break down traditional hierarchical structures as interactions generate respectful behaviour. We present two models of case-based learning to assist in standardising, structuring, and systematising postgraduate interprofessional case-based learning. We have created 12 practical tips for the design, implementation, and evaluation of successful postgraduate interprofessional case-based learning integrated into the existing clinical setting.","author_count":8,"contributors":["Topperzer, Martha Krogh","Roug, Louise Ingerslev","Andres-Jensen, Liv","Pontoppidan, Peter","Hoffmann, Marianne","Larsen, Hanne Bækgaard","Schmiegelow, Kjeld","Sørensen, Jette Led"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-530359"],"filters":{"added":"2022-08","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-U"],"level3":{"HO":["DI-HO-ALL","DI-HO-CAP"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-HO-CAP","DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"twelve tips for postgraduate interprofessional case based learning","src":["ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY-NC-ND","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1080/0142159X.2021.1896691","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-530359","identifier":[{"id":"33761309","type":"pmid"},{"id":"85103063614","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["ku-e54b841f-4e60-4287-8cfb-073faa1a0380"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-C9F78F1F282483EC6119BD00D94C6320"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY-NC-ND","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1080/0142159X.2021.1896691","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY-NC-ND","type":"loc","url":"https://curis.ku.dk/ws/files/311206920/Twelve_tips_for_postgraduate_interprofessional_case_based_learning.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Medicine (MED)"],"yearPub":"2022","yearSub":"2022"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Health and Medical Sciences, Department of Clinical Medicine"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","key":"capital region of denmark","l2":"DI-HO","l2n":"Hospitals","l3":"DI-HO-CAP","l3nl":"Capital Region of Denmark","l3nn":"Capital Region of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Capital Region of Denmark","namevar":["Copenhagen University Hospital - Rigshospitalet"],"nora_code":"DI-HO-CAP","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","country":"dk","first":"Martha Krogh","key":"topperzerpau","last":"Topperzer","locid":"f273fbc3-114d-4bc8-a925-812a0bdd3abb","name":"Topperzer, Martha Krogh","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Louise Ingerslev","key":"rougpau","last":"Roug","locid":"267efa77-cd58-4287-9e1f-e1014c318205","name":"Roug, Louise Ingerslev","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Liv","key":"andrésjensenpau","last":"Andrés-Jensen","locid":"23762606-854b-4a40-831a-9da6952f0b67","name":"Andres-Jensen, Liv","name_org":"Andrés-Jensen, Liv","rank"