7c-403d-a858-2efad1aea498","name":"Sørensen, Suzette","orcid":"0000-0002-4201-1168","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["35025980"],"pub":{"doi":"10.1371/journal.pone.0262618","issn":["19326203"],"issue":"1","journal":"PLOS ONE","paperid":"e0262618","publisher":"Public Library of Science","status":"p","title":"PLOS ONE","title_org":"PLoS ONE","volume":"17"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85123085380"],"search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","Aarhus University","All Danish Affiliations","All Hospitals","All Universities","Central Denmark Region","DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-HO-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Hospitals","North Denmark Region","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-a980c0ee-9039-48a6-b2d8-8261fe61850f","au-d2c2b58a-c308-4b28-bea9-e3826e7cf31a"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University","AU Aarhus University"],"title":"Characteristics of the gut microbiome in women with gestational diabetes mellitus : A systematic review","type":"Journal Review","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S02-097.72-008183","year":"2022","yearsub":"2022"}
{"abstract":"The ability to measure the passage of electrical current with high spatial and temporal resolution is vital for applications ranging from inspection of microscopic electronic circuits to biosensing. The ability to image such signals passively and remotely is of great importance, in order to measure without invasive disruption of the system under study or the signal itself. A recent approach to achieving this utilizes point defects in solid-state materials; in particular, nitrogen-vacancy centers in diamond. Acting as a high-density array of independent sensors, addressable opto-electronically and highly sensitive to factors including temperature and magnetic field, these are ideally suited to microscopic wide-field imaging. In this work, we demonstrate simultaneous spatially and temporally resolved recovery signals from a microscopic lithographically patterned circuit. Through application of a lock-in amplifier camera, we demonstrate micrometer-scale imaging resolution with a millimeter-scale field of view with simultaneous spatially resolved submillisecond (up to 3500 frames s-1) recovery of dc to kilohertz alternating and broadband pulsed-current electrical signals, without aliasing or undersampling. We demonstrate as examples of our method the recovery of synthetic signals replicating digital pulses in integrated circuits and signals that would be observed in a biological neuronal network in the brain.","author_count":12,"contributors":["Webb, James Luke","Troise, Luca","Hansen, Nikolaj W.","Frellsen, Louise Floor","Osterkamp, Christian","Jelezko, Fedor","Jankuhn, Steffen","Meijer, Jan","Berg-Sørensen, Kirstine","Perrier, Jean François","Huck, Alexander","Andersen, Ulrik Lund"],"cuid":["S02-100.00-032915"],"filters":{"added":"2022-09","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"continent":["Europe, EU","OECD"],"corresponding_author":["Andersen, Ulrik Lund","Huck, Alexander","Webb, James Luke"],"country":["Germany"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Leipzig University","Ulm University"],"level":"sci","mra":["med","sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-DTU","DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"high speed wide field imaging of microcircuitry using nitrogen vacancies in diamond","src":["dtu","ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU","DI-U-KU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1103/PhysRevApplied.17.064051","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S02-100.00-032915","identifier":[{"id":"85133719150","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["dtu-0ee8ee9e-1574-4fd1-8ede-2ce51c4dcf42","ku-23fdac59-95d8-4ceb-90a2-f35067f63d63"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science","Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-5-48B015AAB47EBC796BF4EC36DABFE677"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1103/PhysRevApplied.17.064051","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/293797486/PhysRevApplied.17.064051.pdf","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://curis.ku.dk/ws/files/315161774/High_Speed_W.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2022","yearSub":"2022"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark, Department of Physics","Technical University of Denmark, Department of Physics, Quantum Physics and Information Technology"],"nora_code":"DI-U-DTU","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Health and Medical Sciences, Department of Neuroscience, Neuronal Signalling"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"de","key":"ulm university","loc":["Germany","Europe, EU","OECD"],"name":"Ulm University","used":1},{"affno":"4","country":"de","key":"leipzig university","loc":["Germany","Europe, EU","OECD"],"name":"Leipzig University","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"James L.","key":"webbpau","last":"Webb","locid":"5e273d5c-a64c-4433-a332-22416bc6d955","name":"Webb, James Luke","name_org":"Webb, James L.","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Luca","key":"troisepau","last":"Troise","locid":"a4b90577-1519-44bf-accb-28c4f33b6dce","name":"Troise, Luca","orcid":"0000-0002-9471-0999","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","first":"Nikolaj W.","key":"hansenpau","last":"Hansen","locid":"af7e6d22-82f8-4c69-b23a-7a6951c06425","name":"Hansen, Nikolaj Winther","name_org":"Hansen, Nikolaj W.","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Louise F.","key":"frellsenpau","last":"Frellsen","locid":"3d070118-d861-43b3-9175-ecc6ffd7051f","name":"Frellsen, Louise Floor","name_org":"Frellsen, Louise F.","orcid":"0000-0001-9748-3245","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","corresponding":null,"first":"Christian","key":"osterkamppau","last":"Osterkamp","name":"Osterkamp, Christian","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","corresponding":null,"first":"Fedor","key":"jelezkopau","last":"Jelezko","name":"Jelezko, Fedor","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"4","corresponding":null,"first":"Steffen","key":"jankuhnpau","last":"Jankuhn","name":"Jankuhn, Steffen","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"4","corresponding":null,"first":"Jan","key":"meijerpau","last":"Meijer","name":"Meijer, Jan","rank":8,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Kirstine","key":"bergsørensenpau","last":"Berg-Sørensen","locid":"f1c10c27-0fce-408f-88a4-b6262dcb8e98","name":"Berg-Sørensen, Kirstine","orcid":"0000-0002-9977-3980","rank":9,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","first":"Jean François","key":"perrierpau","last":"Perrier","locid":"71b8f851-db1f-4222-89be-5a20d8ac9c1c","name":"Perrier, Jean-Francois Marie","name_org":"Perrier, Jean François","orcid":"0000-0002-9189-3574","rank":10,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Alexander","key":"huckpau","last":"Huck","locid":"43459574-13c2-4da0-8223-df30125179a6","name":"Huck, Alexander","orcid":"0000-0002-2354-5922","rank":11,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Ulrik Lund","key":"andersenpau","last":"Andersen","locid":"d1c6f584-4c31-410d-8879-7669229593fb","name":"Andersen, Ulrik Lund","orcid":"0000-0002-1990-7687","rank":12,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1103/physrevapplied.17.064051","issn":["23317019"],"issue":"6","journal":"Physical Review Applied","paperid":"064051","publisher":"American Physical Society","status":"p","title":"Physical Review Applied","volume":"17"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85133719150"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Technical University of Denmark","Universities","University of Copenhagen"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["dtu-0ee8ee9e-1574-4fd1-8ede-2ce51c4dcf42","ku-23fdac59-95d8-4ceb-90a2-f35067f63d63"],"src":["DTU Technical University of Denmark","KU University of Copenhagen"],"title":"High-Speed Wide-Field Imaging of Microcircuitry Using Nitrogen Vacancies in Diamond","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S02-100.00-032915","year":"2022","yearsub":"2022"}
{"abstract":"Background and Objectives: In recent years, there has been an increased focus among blood bank professionals on the health and safety of blood donors. In 2019, the Danish Haemovigilance Committee designed a national donor vigilance system to improve the registration of adverse reactions (AR) in blood donors. The new donor vigilance system was implemented on 1 January 2020 and we here present the results from the first year of registration. Materials and Methods: AR categories, severity level and imputability score were defined based on the definitions from the International Society of Blood Transfusion, AABB and the European Commission directive 2005/61/EC, respectively. Results: Across all severity levels, AR in Danish blood donors were found to be rare (1498 per 100,000 donations). Only 0.2% of the registered reactions were classified as serious (2.7 per 100,000 donations). Large regional differences were seen in the registration of citrate reactions and haematomas. Conclusion: Significant differences across regions in what to categorize as an AR were persistent even when including a severity score in the reporting. The Danish Haemovigilance Committee will commence a national work to align the definitions but suggests that this matter is raised to an international level as part of the current work to agree upon definitions for assessment of donor AR.","author_count":8,"contributors":["Mikkelsen, Christina","Paarup, Helene Martina","Bruun, Mie Topholm","Pedersen, Louise Ørnskov","Hasslund, Sys","Larsen, Rune","Aagaard, Bitten","Sørensen, Betina Samuelsen"],"cuid":["S03-093.88-005573"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":3,"corresponding_author":["Mikkelsen, Christina"],"keyword":["Blood Banks","Blood Donors","Blood Safety","Blood Transfusion","Denmark","Donor health","Donors","Humans","blood collection","haemovigilance"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-OT","DI-U"],"level3":{"HO":["DI-HO-ALL","DI-HO-CDR","DI-HO-NDR","DI-HO-SDR","DI-HO-ZEA"],"OT":["Danish Medicines Agency"],"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-HO-CDR","DI-HO-NDR","DI-HO-SDR","DI-HO-ZEA","DI-U-AAU","DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"the new donor vigilance system in denmark reveals regional differences in adverse reactions supposedly caused by variation in the registration","src":["aau","ku","sdu"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://findresearcher.sdu.dk/ws/files/193320053/vox.13202.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"},"id":"S03-093.88-005573","identifier":[{"id":"85114901375","type":"scopus"},{"id":"34523137","type":"pmid"}],"ids":["aau-72e053af-bd76-4472-8cbd-dbd5e859e7e4","ku-38979e12-33d9-4d89-94ae-f528bab869fd","sdu-ebc05d0f-260b-456e-bc29-bdd4f12a29ab"],"keyword":["Blood Banks","Blood Donors","Blood Safety","Blood Transfusion","Denmark","Humans","blood collection","donor health","donors","haemovigilance"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-6-28F14AF408EFA0709DEDF46540F5709E"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://findresearcher.sdu.dk/ws/files/193320053/vox.13202.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"},{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://curis.ku.dk/ws/files/358652494/vox.13202_2_18.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Medicine (MED)"],"yearPub":"2022","yearSub":"2022"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Health and Medical Sc