{"abstract":"Youtubere. Influencere. Gamere. Digitaliseringen af vores samfund skaber nye måder at arbejde på og nye typer af jobs, som ikke mindst slår igennem blandt unge. I platformsøkonomien kan man efterspørge og tilbyde tjenester og ydelser, og her er der hverken arbejdsgivere eller arbejdstager i traditionel forstand. I dette afsnit skal vi prøve at forstå, hvad den teknologiske udvikling betyder for unges arbejdsliv nu og fremover. Hvad betyder det for organiseringen af arbejdet, og hvad man skal kunne? Og hvad betyder den her type arbejde for ens ungdomsliv i videre forstand?","author_count":3,"contributors":["Sørensen, Niels Ulrik","Nielsen,, Louise Yung","Nielsen, Mette Lykke"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-794551"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"pop","mra":["hum"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL","DI-U-RUC"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-RUC"]},"review":"und","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"000000000010 tendenser i ungdomslivet 000000000002 000000000010 ingen chef ingen rettigheder","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dnt","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"https://podcasts.google.com/feed/aHR0cHM6Ly9mZWVkcy5idXp6c3Byb3V0LmNvbS8xMzU1ODI3LnJzcw/episode/QnV6enNwcm91dC01NjcyMDMy?sa=X&ved=0CAQQkfYCahcKEwjoj-Xt4JDtAhUAAAAAHQAAAAAQAQ","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-794551","ids":["aau-605d69bc-ce4a-4974-b65a-f39b502a8682"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Popular","mra":["Humanities"],"noi":["Local-1-1-42CDB0B33749601710D34BF8C8E88751"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"https://podcasts.google.com/feed/aHR0cHM6Ly9mZWVkcy5idXp6c3Byb3V0LmNvbS8xMzU1ODI3LnJzcw/episode/QnV6enNwcm91dC01NjcyMDMy?sa=X&ved=0CAQQkfYCahcKEwjoj-Xt4JDtAhUAAAAAHQAAAAAQAQ","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Humanities","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Social Sciences and Humanities, Department of Culture and Learning","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Social Sciences and Humanities, Department of Culture and Learning, Centre for Youth Research (CeFU)"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","key":"ruc roskilde university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-RUC","l3nl":"Roskilde University","l3nn":"RUC Roskilde University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"RUC Roskilde University","namevar":["Roskilde University"],"nora_code":"DI-U-RUC","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Niels Ulrik","key":"sørensennielsulrikppu","last":"Sørensen","locid":"bc0b7e8d-a533-48e9-812c-c47dc3057f8e","name":"Sørensen, Niels Ulrik","orcid":"0000-0001-6410-1183","rank":1,"role":"Publisher","rolecode":"ppu"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Louise Yung","key":"nielsenlouiseyungppu","last":"Nielsen,","name":"Nielsen,, Louise Yung","rank":2,"role":"Publisher","rolecode":"ppu"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Mette Lykke","key":"nielsenmettelykkeppu","last":"Nielsen","locid":"33131688-dbd7-457e-85aa-0229ea2c05f4","name":"Nielsen, Mette Lykke","orcid":"0000-0001-8834-9159","rank":3,"role":"Publisher","rolecode":"ppu"}],"pub":{"publisher":"Center for Ungdomsforskning","status":"p"},"review":"Undetermined","search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Roskilde University","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-605d69bc-ce4a-4974-b65a-f39b502a8682"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University"],"title":"10 tendenser i ungdomslivet 2:10 : Ingen chef, ingen rettigheder","type":"Non-Textual Item","