zeneckerpau","last":"Hetzenecker","name":"Hetzenecker, M.","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","corresponding":null,"first":"A.","key":"shepherdpau","last":"Shepherd","name":"Shepherd, A.","rank":8,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"4","corresponding":null,"first":"A.","key":"grohpau","last":"Groh","name":"Groh, A.","rank":9,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"5","corresponding":null,"first":"A.","key":"solgaardpau","last":"Solgaard","name":"Solgaard, A.","rank":10,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"6","corresponding":null,"first":"M.","key":"engdahlpau","last":"Engdahl","name":"Engdahl, M.","rank":11,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"status":"p"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","sdg":["13. Climate Action","All UN SDG Classification"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Governmental Institutions","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-GV","DI-GV-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Governmental Institutions","Technical University of Denmark","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["dtu-677e994b-6857-4161-bd14-9e89e3e269ba"],"src":["DTU Technical University of Denmark"],"title":"25 Year Time Series of Multiple-Satellite Ice Sheet Changes: the ESA Climate Change Initiative","type":"Conference Abstract","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-335484","year":"2018","yearsub":"2018"}
{"abstract":"Objectives: We have established an open source platform for non-invasive prenatal testing (NIPT) based on massively parallel whole-genome sequencing in a public setting. The objective of this study was to investigate factors of importance for correct interpretation of NIPT results to ensure a high sensitivity and specificity. Study design: This investigation is a retrospective case-control study performed in a public NIPT center. The study included 108 aneuploid cases and 165 euploid controls. MPS was performed on circulating cell-free DNA in maternal blood. The pipeline included automated library preparation and sequencing on a HiSeq1500 (Illumina). The software programmes WISECONDOR and SeqFF were used for data analysis of aneuploidy status and fetal fraction of cell-free DNA, respectively. Lower limit of fetal fraction for aneuploidy testing was 0.02. Results: We identified four false negative aneuploidy cases of which two were explained by a vanishing twin. The number of no-call cases due to low fetal fraction was 8 out of 273 (2.9%). The sensitivity and specificity, when no-calls and vanished twins were excluded, were 100% and 99.5% for T21, 91% and 99.2% for T18, and 100% and 99.6% for T13. By multiple regression analysis we found a significant association between fetal fraction and gestational age, maternal BMI and ART treatment. Conclusion: With a non-commercial open source NIPT set-up having the same high test-performance as reported by large private laboratories, we show that fetal fraction, a vanishing twin, BMI, gestational age and ART treatment are important factors in the interpretation of NIPT results.","author_count":7,"contributors":["Hartwig, Tanja S.","Ambye, Louise","Werge, Lene","Weiergang, Martin Kenneth","Nørgaard, Pernille","Sørensen, Steen","Jørgensen, Finn Stener"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-414036"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Aneuploidy","Cell free DNA","Non Invasive prenatal testing","Prenatal Diagnosis","Sensitivity and Specificity"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-U"],"level3":{"HO":["DI-HO-ALL","DI-HO-CAP"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-HO-CAP","DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"non invasive prenatal testing nipt in pregnancies with trisomy 000000000021 000000000018 and 000000000013 performed in a public setting factors of importance for correct interpretation of results","src":["ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-414036","identifier":[{"id":"85047246225","type":"scopus"},{"id":"29804026","type":"pmid"}],"ids":["ku-227db585-2f03-4c15-a00e-42ca81c9aa0b"],"keyword":["Aneuploidy","Cell-free DNA","Non-Invasive prenatal testing","Prenatal diagnosis","Sensitivity and specificity"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-D98DC3FC5364C94281FF32C9F76B535D"],"oai":{"class":"Unused","mra":["Medicine (MED)"],"yearPub":"2018","yearSub":"2018"},"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"dk","key":"capital region of denmark","l2":"DI-HO","l2n":"Hospitals","l3":"DI-HO-CAP","l3nl":"Capital Region of Denmark","l3nn":"Capital Region of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Capital Region of Denmark","namevar":["Copenhagen University Hospital - Amager and Hvidovre"],"nora_code":"DI-HO-CAP","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Health and Medical Sciences, Department of Clinical Medicine, Department of Clinical Medicine","Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Health and Medical Sciences, Department of Clinical Medicine, Obstetrics an