{"abstract":"The decision to limit or discontinue treatment is a difficult issue, which all physicians will face. Timely communication with information on treatment possibilities and limitations, respectful listening to patients' and informal caregivers' wishes and early palliation is recommended in a stable phase. In some situations, it is better to stop life-prolonging treatment and optimise quality of life in patients with benign pulmonary diseases. Decision on treatment limitations or discontinuation is best taken at a conference and should be based on the patient's wishes, the disease stage and progression and potential reversible components.","author_count":13,"contributors":["Sørensen, Anita Rath","Bendstrup, Elisabeth","Løkke, Anders","Titlestad, Ingrid Louise","Jensen, Jens Ulrik","Thomsen, Laura","Roberts, Nassim","Gjørup, Pia","Shaker, Saher","Gundestrup, Svend","Wilcke, Torgny","Weinreich, Ulla Møller","Marsaa, Kristoffer"],"cuid":["S02-084.57-741425"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"level":"sci","mra":["med","sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-U"],"level3":{"HO":["DI-HO-ALL","DI-HO-CAP","DI-HO-CDR","DI-HO-SDR"],"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-HO-CAP","DI-HO-CDR","DI-HO-SDR","DI-U-AAU","DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"behandlingsniveau og behandlingsstop ved benign lungesygdom treatment limitations or discontinuation in patients with benign pulmonary diseases","src":["aau","ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-KU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"http://ugeskriftet.dk/videnskab/behandlingsniveau-og-behandlingsstop-ved-benign-lungesygdom","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S02-084.57-741425","identifier":[{"id":"85054090930","type":"scopus"},{"id":"30274574","type":"pmid"}],"ids":["aau-7799001f-4544-4347-800f-f8f99f