{"abstract":"Film der introducerer hvordan HistorieLabs digitale læremiddel \"Kildebanken\" kan benyttes til undervisning i historiefaget.","author_count":3,"contributors":["Sørensen, Christina Louise","Lauridsen, Poul Kjær","Peters, Rikke"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-648599"],"filters":{"added":"2023-01","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Film","Formidling","Kildekritik","Læring pædagogik og undervisning","Undervisning","historiefaget","kildebank"],"level":"edu","oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-UC"],"level3":{"UC":["DI-UC-ALL","DI-UC-UCL"]},"level3all":["DI-UC-UCL"]},"review":"und","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"hvad er kildebanken","src":["ucl"],"src-code":["DI-UC-UCL"],"type":"dnt","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3gnazQfalMM","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-648599","ids":["ucl-9949adcc-998d-463b-95c1-b1bb4d2d749d"],"keyword":["Film","Læring, pædagogik og undervisning","formidling","historiefaget","kildebank","kildekritik","triggerfilm","undervisning"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Educational","noi":["Local-1-1-802903E600A41D42336D1C302472D474"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3gnazQfalMM","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"ucl university college","l2":"DI-UC","l2n":"University Colleges","l3":"DI-UC-UCL","l3nl":"UCL University College","l3nn":"UCL University College","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"UCL University College","namevar":["UCL Erhvervsakademi og Professionshøjskole, Rektor, Rektor, Videncenter for Historie og Kulturformidling"],"nora_code":"DI-UC-UCL","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Christina Louise","key":"sørensenpau","last":"Sørensen","locid":"c4715900-2e37-4a8f-9c8b-77690089c2c4","name":"Sørensen, Christina Louise","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Poul Kjær","key":"lauridsenppu","last":"Lauridsen","locid":"d50179d4-5a35-4a3c-b628-ad1543edeff8","name":"Lauridsen, Poul Kjær","rank":2,"role":"Publisher","rolecode":"ppu"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Rikke Louise Alberg","key":"peterspau","last":"Peters","locid":"c08a1671-9716-48a1-a1b9-2f07a47a57e9","name":"Peters, Rikke","name_org":"Peters, Rikke Louise Alberg","orcid":"0000-0003-0120-370X","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"publisher":"Nationalt Videnscenter for Historie- og Kulturformidling","status":"p"},"review":"Undetermined","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All University Colleges","DI-ALL","DI-UC","DI-UC-ALL","UCL University College","University Colleges"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ucl-9949adcc-998d-463b-95c1-b1bb4d2d749d"],"src":["UCL University College"],"title":"Hvad er Kildebanken?","type":"Non-Textual Item","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-648599","year":"2018","yearsub":"2018"}
{"abstract":"Læreplanen Forenklede Fælles Mål for historie lægger op til, at eleverne arbejder mere undersøgende og problemorienteret med kilder. Men hvordan foregår det i praksis? I 2017 gennemførte forskere ved HistorieLab et større aktionsforskningsprojekt med fokus på netop dette spørgsmål, og nu er rapporten klar. Rapporten “Kan elever arbejde problemorienteret med kilder i historie?” gør rede for aktionsforsknings- og udviklingsprojektet “Elevgenerede læremidler” samt skitserer ideer, forslag og anbefalinger, som kan udledes af de gennemførte aktioner. Som afslutning indeholder rapporten konkrete forslag til, hvordan undervisningen kan tilrettelægges, så elevernes undersøgelses- og metodiske kompetencer styrkes. Rapporten er relevant for lærere, der underviser i historie og andre kulturfag i grundskolen, studerende på læreruddannelsen med historie som undervisningsfag og for forskere og andre, der interesserer sig for elevernes læreprocesser.","author_count":4,"contributors":["Larsen, Dorthe Godsk","Peters, Rikke","Poulsen, Jens Aage","Sørensen, Christina Louise"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-649216"],"filters":{"added":"2023-01","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"pop","oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-UC"],"level3":{"UC":["DI-UC-ALL","DI-UC-UCL"]},"level3all":["DI-UC-UCL"]},"review":"und","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"kan elever arbejde problemorienteret med kilder i historie","src":["ucl"],"src-code":["DI-UC-UCL"],"type":"dr","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY-ND","type":"rem","url":"http://historielab.dk/til-undervisningen/udgivelser/kan-elever-arbejde-problemorienteret-kilder-historie/","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-649216","ids":["ucl-c3c8cc6b-1fe2-42f6-b4e0-166b6d9cf1fb"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Popular","noi":["Local-1-1-2C2B0F8C1E98F3C1FACA91ACD05AB6BD"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY-ND","type":"rem","url":"http://historielab.dk/til-undervisningen/udgivelser/kan-elever-arbejde-problemorienteret-kilder-historie/","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"ucl university college","l2":"DI-UC","l2n":"University Colleges","l3":"DI-UC-UCL","l3nl":"UCL University College","l3nn":"UCL University College","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"UCL University College","namevar":["UCL Erhvervsakademi og Professionshøjskole, Rektor, Rektor, Videncenter for Historie og Kulturformidling"],"nora_code":"DI-UC-UCL","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Dorthe Godsk","key":"larsenpau","last":"Larsen","locid":"89ea5183-573e-4301-b156-fcd7cf8b2aec","name":"Larsen, Dorthe Godsk","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Rikke Louise Alberg","key":"peterspau","last":"Peters","locid":"c08a1671-9716-48a1-a1b9-2f07a47a57e9","name":"Peters, Rikke","name_org":"Peters, Rikke Louise Alberg","orcid":"0000-0003-0120-370X","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Jens Aage","key":"poulsenpau","last":"Poulsen","locid":"2fe2921a-cbaa-4e8f-b6f0-fdf98dda45ae","name":"Poulsen, Jens Aage","orcid":"0000-0001-9617-4336","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Christina Louise","key":"sørensenpau","last":"Sørensen","locid":"c4715900-2e37-4a8f-9c8b-77690089c2c4","name":"Sørensen, Christina Louise","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"isbn":["9788793663121"],"place":"Odense","publisher":"Nationalt Videnscenter for Historie- og Kulturformidling","status":"p","volume":"1"},"review":"Undetermined","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All University Colleges","DI-ALL","DI-UC","DI-UC-ALL","UCL University College","University Colleges"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ucl-c3c8cc6b-1fe2-42f6-b4e0-166b6d9cf1fb"],"src":["UCL University College"],"title":"Kan elever arbejde problemorienteret med kilder i historie?","type":"Report","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/se