{"abstract":"Background: Reliable biomarkers in patients (pts) with pancreatic cancer (PC) are highly warranted. The aim of this prospective-retrospective biomarker study was to investigate the clinical value of cell-free DNA (cfDNA) in pts with PC.Methods: A total of 377 consecutive pts with histologically confirmed PC and 94 healthy controls were included. Total cfDNA levels were determined by a direct fluorescent assay in EDTA plasma samples obtained before operation (stage I and II) or start of palliative chemotherapy (stage III and IV). Serum CA19-9 (IMMULITE 2000, Siemens), hyaluronic acid (HA) (ELISA, R\\amp;D), interleukin-6 (IL-6) (ELISA, R\\amp;D) and YKL-40 (ELISA, Quidel) were measured. The main outcome was association of cfDNA with overall survival (OS) for pts with PC. Hazard ratios (HRs) and 95\\% confidence intervals (CIs) were estimated by Cox proportional hazards regression.","author_count":21,"contributors":["Chen, I","Wind, K L","Dehlendorff, C","Sørensen, B S","Vittrup, B V","Johansen, A","Pfeiffer, P","Bjerregaard, J K","Bojesen, S E","Nielsen, S E","Holländer, N H","Yilmaz, Mette Karen","Rasmussen, Louise Skau","Pallisgaard, N","Johansen, J S","Spindler, K-L G"],"cuid":["S02-088.15-001728"],"event":{"end":"2018-10-23","place":"München, de","start":"2018-10-19","title":"ESMO 2018 Congress (European Society for Medical Oncology)","year":"2018"},"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-U"],"level3":{"HO":["DI-HO-ALL","DI-HO-CDR","DI-HO-ZEA"],"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-HO-CDR","DI-HO-ZEA","DI-U-AAU","DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"clinical utility of plasma cell free dna in patients with pancreatic cancer","src":["aau","sdu"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-SDU"],"type":"dca","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1093/annonc/mdy282.098","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S02-088.15-001728","identifier":[{"id":"85042236153","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-223ae558-8363-4d4f-9b6d-0836044a2717","sdu-49b8e55e-e7f1-4dd2-bb15-208459c00d0d"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-D087DF1509BC512768E8B53336BF1D5A"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1093/annonc/mdy282.098","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"sdu university of southern denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-SDU","l3nl":"University of Southern Denmark","l3nn":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","namevar":["SDU, The Faculty of Health Sciences, Department of Clinical Research, KI, OUH, Research unit of Oncology (Odense)"],"nora_code":"DI-U-SDU","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Medicine","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Medicine, Aalborg University Hospital","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Medicine, Aalborg University Hospital, Department of Oncology","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Medicine, Aalborg University Hospital, Klinik Kirurgi og Kræftbehandling"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"dk","key":"region zealand","l2":"DI-HO","l2n":"Hospitals","l3":"DI-HO-ZEA","l3nl":"Region Zealand","l3nn":"Region Zealand","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Region Zealand","namevar":["Zealand University Hospital"],"nora_code":"DI-HO-ZEA","used":1},{"affno":"4","country":"dk","key":"central denmark region","l2":"DI-HO","l2n":"Hospitals","l3":"DI-HO-CDR","l3nl":"Cent