{"abstract":"Artiklen indeholder udviklingen og afprøvningen af en ordforrådstest designet specielt til universi- tetsstuderende. Testen er en elektronisk, revideret version af ’Hvilket billede passer til ordet’ udviklet med udgangspunkt i de billeder og ord, der bruges i Vejledende Læsetest for Voksne (VLV). Der rapporteres resultater fra en afprøvning af 220 universitetsstuderende.","author_count":3,"contributors":["Sørensen, Louise Langhoff","Ravn, Ida Elise","Weed, Ethan"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-169899"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["hum"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU"]},"review":"nr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"testning af alment ordforråd hos danske universitetsstuderende et normeringsstudie","src":["au"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-169899","ids":["au-472002b3-d6ae-40e1-811b-e38ea88b7b52"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Scientific","mra":["Humanities"],"noi":["Local-1-1-B225280EF07A1891D5E913BE2155AEF3"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Arts, School of Communication and Culture, School of Communication and Culture - Linguistics"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Louise Langhoff","key":"sørensenpau","last":"Sørensen","locid":"a88dcf2e-fdc7-4501-86b9-28d50f028f4c","name":"Sørensen, Louise Langhoff","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Ida Elise","key":"ravnpau","last":"Ravn","locid":"73c88aa0-c769-4e54-ba93-804b1b5a2f0c","name":"Ravn, Ida Elise","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1",