s":"p","subtitle":"Seks fortællinger fra samfundets maskinrum","title":"Når ledere skaber offentlig værdi"},"review":"Undetermined","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","Copenhagen Business School","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["cbs-fa7ca200-85ab-4a81-887d-966a5f303b15"],"src":["CBS Copenhagen Business School"],"title":"At være den røde tråd : Eik Møller, direktør i Ballerup Kommune","type":"Book Chapter","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-299301","year":"2017","yearsub":"2017"}
{"abstract":"Monthly gravity field models from the GRACE satellite mission are widely used to determine ice mass changes of large ice sheets as well as smaller glaciers and ice caps. Here, we investigate in detail the ice mass changes of the Icelandic ice caps as derived from GRACE data. The small size of the Icelandic ice caps, their location close to other rapidly changing ice covered areas and the low viscosity of the mantle below Iceland make this especially challenging. The mass balance of the ice caps is well constrained by field mass balance measurements, making this area ideal for such investigations. We find that the ice mass changes of the Icelandic ice caps derived from GRACE gravity field models are influenced by both the large gravity change signal resulting from ice mass loss in southeast Greenland and the mass redistribution within the Earth mantle due to glacial isostatic adjustment since the Little Ice Age (∼ 1890 AD). To minimize the signal that leaks towards Iceland from Greenland, we employ an independent mass change estimate of the Greenland Ice Sheet derived from satellite laser altimetry. We also estimate the effect of post Little Ice Age glacial isostatic adjustment, from knowledge of the ice history and GPS network constrained crustal deformation data. We find that both the leakage from Greenland and the post Little Ice Age glacial isostatic adjustment are important to take into account, in order to correctly determine Iceland ice mass changes from GRACE, and when applying these an average mass balance of the Icelandic ice caps of -11.4 +/- 2.2 Gt yr-1 for the period 2003-2010 is found. This number corresponds well with available mass balance measurements.","author_count":8,"contributors":["Sørensen, Louise Sandberg","Jarosch, Alexander H.","Adalgeirsdottir, Gudfinna","Barletta, Valentina Roberta","Forsberg, René","Pálsson, Finnur","Bjornsson, Helgi","Johannesson, Tomas"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-312966"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Europe, Non-EU","Nordic","OECD"],"country":["Iceland"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","University of Iceland"],"keyword":["Acceleration","Antarctica","Arctic region","Balance","Caps","Earth","Geochemistry","Glaciology","Global change from geodesy","Greenland","Inverse theory","Sea level rise","Surface","Time variable gravity","Variability"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-DTU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"the effect of signal leakage and glacial isostatic rebound on grace derived ice mass changes in iceland","src":["dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/132025944/ggx008.pdf","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-312966","identifier":[{"id":"85019892572","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["dtu-1c1b1cbc-3c5c-4962-b23d-44e9d830c814"],"keyword":["ACCELERATION","ANTARCTICA","Arctic region","BALANCE","CAPS","EARTH","GEOCHEMISTRY","GREENLAND","Glaciology","Global change from geodesy","Inverse theory","SEA-LEVEL RISE","SURFACE","TIME-VARIABLE GRAVITY","VARIABILITY"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-1A7913C090AAE4D2C5EE1B878F1770C2"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/132025944/ggx008.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2017","yearSub":"2017"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark, National Space Institute","Technical University of Denmark, National Space Institute, Geodynamics"],"nora_code":"DI-U-DTU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"is","key":"university of iceland","loc":["Iceland","Europe, Non-EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"University of Iceland","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Louise Sandberg","key":"sørensenpau","last":"Sørensen","locid":"1c6cb90f-da30-48a2-872f-a94b8100749b","name":"Sørensen, Louise Sandberg","orcid":"0000-0002-3771-4061","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Alexander H.","key":"jaroschpau","last":"Jarosch","name":"Jarosch, Alexander H.","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Gudfinna","key":"adalgeirsdottirpau","last":"Adalgeirsdottir","name":"Adalgeirsdottir, Gudfinna","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Valentina Roberta","key":"barlettapau","last":"Barletta","locid":"9662b7b8-5901-45b2-bba3-dd8e3879f864","name":"Barletta, Valentina Roberta","orcid":"0000-0003-4427-0830","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"René","key":"forsbergpau","last":"Forsberg","locid":"be93c88f-cc39-43d8-bf6f-ff4787c55c23","name":"Forsberg, René","orcid":"0000-0002-7288-9545","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Finnur","key":"pálssonpau","last":"Pálsson","name":"Pálsson, Finnur","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Helgi","key":"bjornssonpau","last":"Bjornsson","name":"Bjornsson, Helgi","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Tomas","key":"johannessonpau","last":"Johannesson","name":"Johannesson, Tomas","rank":8,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1093/gji/ggx008","issn":["0956540X","1365246X"],"issn_org":["0956540X"],"issue":"1","journal":"Geophysical Journal International","pages":"226-233","publisher":"Oxford University Press","status":"p","title":"Geophysical Journal In