{"abstract":"We present a case of persistent trophoblast tissue (PT) five weeks after salpingectomy for tubal pregnancy. The fallopian tube-sparing method (salpingotomy) has a greater risk of PT than removal of the whole fallopian tube (salpingectomy) has. A 32-year-old woman was treated with salpingectomy on suspicion of a bleeding ectopic pregnancy and was readmitted due to PT. There is no evidence for measuring the human chorionic gonadotropin (hCG) level as routine follow-up after salpingectomy, but it is important to be aware of the risk of PT and if in doubt measure the levels of hCG.","author_count":3,"contributors":["Hornstrup, Louise Stig","Sørensen, Bjarke Lund","Wetterstrand, Vicky Jenny-Rebecka"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-480345"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Adult","Female","Humans","Postoperative Complications blood","Pregnancy","Salpingectomy adverse effects"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"persisterende trofoblastvæv efter salpingektomi","src":["ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"http://ugeskriftet.dk/videnskab/persisterende-trofoblastvaev-efter-salpingektomi","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-480345","identifier":[{"id":"29139356","type":"pmid"},{"id":"85058901587","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["ku-916ed1df-46ae-44db-9b16-fbcb169483c8"],"keyword":["Adult","Female","Humans","Postoperative Complications/blood","Pregnancy","Pregnancy, Tubal/blood","Salpingectomy/adverse effects","Trophoblasts/pathology"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-2-FCCDCFC125106F9AA44FC26911DE1A54"],"oai":{"class":"Blocked","mra":["Medicine (MED)"],"yearPub":"2017","yearSub":"2018"},"org"