{"abstract":"Den digitale kildebank består af flere end 130 kilder, der er inddelt i de 12 temaer. I hvert tema stilledes der mellem 10-15 kilder til rådighed om slavehandelen, slavernes liv og arbejde på De Dansk Vestindiske Øer og meget mere. Til læremidlet er også udviklet lærervejledninger, opgaver og triggere til at komme igang med undervisningen. Til brug for elever i 5.-9. klasse.","author_count":3,"contributors":["Sørensen, Christina Louise","Poulsen, Jens Aage","Peters, Rikke"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-648303"],"filters":{"added":"2023-01","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Dansk Vestindien","Historie","Kildekritik","Kilder","Læremiddel","Læring pædagogik og undervisning","Problemorientering","Slaveri","Undervisningsmateriale","elevaktivering","kildebank"],"level":"pop","oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-UC"],"level3":{"UC":["DI-UC-ALL","DI-UC-UCL"]},"level3all":["DI-UC-UCL"]},"review":"und","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"kildebankemne slaveriet og vestindien","src":["ucl"],"src-code":["DI-UC-UCL"],"type":"doo","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"http://historielab.dk/til-undervisningen/kildebank/vestindienkildebank-2/%20","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-648303","ids":["ucl-841bd28e-8624-4857-8828-43dc818685cf"],"keyword":["Dansk Vestindien","Læring, pædagogik og undervisning","elevaktivering","historie","kildebank","kildekritik","kilder","læremiddel","problemorientering","slaveri","undervisningsmateriale"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Popular","noi":["Local-1-1-CD667A1B2EC441171CD4857F937AFFFB"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"http://historielab.dk/til-undervisningen/kildebank/vestindienkildebank-2/%20","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"ucl university college","l2":"DI-UC","l2n":"University Colleges","l3":"DI-UC-UCL","l3nl":"UCL University College","l3nn":"UCL University College","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"UCL University College","namevar":["UCL Erhvervsakademi og Professionshøjskole, Rektor, Rektor, Videncenter for Historie og Kulturformidling"],"nora_code":"DI-UC-UCL","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Christina Louise","key":"sørensenpau","last":"Sørensen","locid":"c4715900-2e37-4a8f-9c8b-77690089c2c4","name":"Sørensen, Christina Louise","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Jens Aage","key":"poulsenpau","last":"Poulsen","locid":"2fe2921a-cbaa-4e8f-b6f0-fdf98dda45ae","name":"Poulsen, Jens Aage","orcid":"0000-0001-9617-4336","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Rikke Louise Alberg","key":"peterspau","last":"Peters","locid":"c08a1671-9716-48a1-a1b9-2f07a47a57e9","name":"Peters, Rikke","name_org":"Peters, Rikke Louise Alberg","orcid":"0000-0003-0120-370X","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"publisher":"Nationalt Videnscenter for Historie- og Kulturformidling","status":"p"},"review":"Undetermined","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All University Colleges","DI-ALL","DI-UC","DI-UC-ALL","UCL University College","University Colleges"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ucl-841bd28e-8624-4857-8828-43dc818685cf"],"src":["UCL University College"],"title":"Kildebankemne: Slaveriet og Vestindien","type":"Other-Unknown","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-648303","year":"2017","yearsub":"2017"}
{"abstract":"Recent years has proven strong intentions towards an occupation-based curriculum. Educating “specialists in doing” (2 p.95) sets the intention of making occupation the core assumption of occupational therapy, both in practice and in the curriculum. A gap has occurred between the means of teaching occupation as a theoretical concept, and learning and mastering occupation as a competence. We learn from doing, sharing the doing and developing skills through doing (1). How do we design the curriculum so that the students can embody the power and meaning of occupation? By rethinking curriculum we designed “Exploratorium of occupation”. A learning space to explore and do occupation. Students reflect and work on challenges, feelings, motivation, adaptation and adjustments to seek the potential of their chosen occupation. Experience is shared and participants will participate in exploring learning about occupation.","author_count":3,"contributors":["Lunn, Tine Bieber Kirkegaard","Sørensen, Marie-Louise","Østergaard, Amanda"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-652421"],"event":{"end":"2017-10-28","place":"Zagreb, , hr","start":"2017-10-26","title":"ENOTHE 2017","year":"2017"},"filters":{"added":"2023-01","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"pop","oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-UC"],"level3":{"UC":["DI-UC-ALL","DI-UC-UCN"]},"level3all":["DI-UC-UCN"]},"review":"und","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"how to explore learning as an occupational experience","src":["ucn"],"src-code":["DI-UC-UCN"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-652421","ids":["ucn-df4bef6b-5af0-4b62-8164-875259a94a4b"],"lang":"English","level":"Popular","noi":["Local-1-1-D6742DD78FAF1F1410CC1F09D76D7274"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"ucn university college of northern denmark","l2":"DI-UC","l2n":"University Colleges","l3":"DI-UC-UCN","l3nl":"University College of Northern Denmark","l3nn":"UCN University