-72","publisher":"John Wiley & Sons Inc.","status":"p","title":"Alimentary Pharmacology and Therapeutics","volume":"41"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-84922936773"],"search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","Aarhus University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["au-7b69804f-8d58-4871-95d4-959f9d89d64c"],"src":["AU Aarhus University"],"title":"Chronic liver disease and 90-day mortality in 21,359 patients following peptic ulcer bleeding--a Nationwide Cohort Study","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-199938","year":"2015","yearsub":"2015"}
