{"abstract":"Normally, a consistent basis for calculating partial factors focuses on a homogeneous reliability index neither depending on which material the structure is constructed of nor the ratio between the permanent and variable actions acting on the structure. Furthermore, the reliability index should not depend on the type of variable action. A probability based calibration of pressure coefficients have been carried out using pressure measurements on the standard CAARC building modelled on scale of 1:383. The extreme pressures measured on the CAARC building model in the wind tunnel have been fitted to Gumbel distributions, and these fits are found to represent the data measured with good accuracy. The pressure distributions found have been used in a calibration of partial factors, which should achieve a certain theoretical target reliability index. For a target annual reliability index of 4.3, the Eurocode partial factor of 1.5 for variable actions agrees well with the inherent uncertainties of wind actions when the pressure coefficients are determined using wind tunnel test results. The increased bias and uncertainty when pressure coefficients mainly are based on structural codes lead to a larger partial factor of the order of 1.8. In order to put the partial factors determined into perspective, calculations have also been carried out for structures exposed to snow load. Assuming a target annual reliability index of 4.3, the partial factors for snow load may become as high as approx. 3.0 when the characteristic shape coefficients are based on mean values as specified in background documents to the Eurocodes. Importance of hidden safeties judging the reliability is discussed for wind actions on low-rise structures.","author_count":3,"contributors":["Hansen, Svend Ole","Pedersen, Marie Louise","Sørensen, John Dalsgaard"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-075839"],"event":{"end":"2015-06-26","place":"Porto Alegre, br","start":"2015-06-21","title":"International Conference on Wind Engineering","year":"2015"},"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Eurocodes","Partial factors","Pressure coefficients","Probabilistic design method","Snow loads","Wind actions","Wind tunnel tests"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-PR","DI-U"],"level3":{"PR":["DI-PR-ALL","DI-PR-OTH"],"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-PR-OTH","DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"probability based calibration of pressure coefficients","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-075839","ids":["aau-58ede2bf-ebb2-4755-976c-e56a9ecb21de"],"keyword":["Eurocodes","Partial factors","Pressure coefficients","Probabilistic design method","Snow loads","Wind actions","Wind tunnel tests"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-73032C418C0FFD53F2F1732A370E15C1"],"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"dk","key":"other companies","l2":"DI-PR","l2n":"Private Research","l3":"DI-PR-OTH","l3nl":"Other Companies","l3nn":"Other Companies","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Other Companies","namevar":["Svend Ole Hansen ApS"],"nora_code":"DI-PR-OTH","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science (ENG)","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, Department of Civil Engineering","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, Department of Civil Engineering, Division for Structures, Materials and Geotechnics (CIVIL)","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, Department of Civil Engineering, Division of Reliability, Dynamics and Marine Engineering (CIVIL)","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, Department of Civil Engineering, Reliability and Risk Analysis Research Group","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, Department of the Built Environment, Danish Centre for Risk and Safety Management","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, Department of the Built Environment, Division of Structures, Geotechnics and Risk"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Svend Ole","key":"hansenpau","last":"Hansen","name":"Hansen, Svend Ole","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Marie Louise","key":"pedersenpau","last":"Pedersen","name":"Pedersen, Marie Louise","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"John Dalsgaard","key":"sørensenpau","last":"Sørensen","locid":"6fe22c77-cd3d-4e06-9337-3f870be8f135","name":"Sørensen, John Dalsgaard","orcid":"0000-0001-6987-6877","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"place":"Porto Alegre","publisher":"14th international conference on wind engineering","status":"p","subtitle":"14th international conference on wind engineering","title":"The ICWE14 Conference Proceedings"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","All Danish Affiliations","All Private Research","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-PR","DI-PR-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Other Companies","Private Research","Universities","svend ole hansen aps"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-58ede2bf-ebb2-4755-976c-e56a9ecb21de"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University"],"title":"Probability based calibration of pressure coefficients","type":"Conference Paper","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-075839","year":"2015","yearsub":"2015"}
{"abstract":"Denmark was previously iodine deficient with regional differences. Moderate iodine deficiency appeared in West Denmark and mild iodine deficiency in East Denmark and also Danish pregnant and breastfeeding women suffered from iodine deficiency. The Danish mandatory iodine fortification of salt was introduced in the year 2000 and has increased iodine intake in the Danish population. However, median urinary iodine concentration in the general population and in pregnant and breastfeeding women is still below the level recommended, corresponding to mild iodine deficiency. Certain characteristics may challenge the evaluation of urinary iodine status in pregnancy and during breastfeeding. This review also addresses methodological challenges related to spot urine sampling conditions and the use of iodine supplement and discusses the use of non-pregnant population groups as a proxy for iodine intake in pregnant women.","author_count":8,"contributors":["Andersen, Stine Linding","Sørensen, Louise Kolding","Motavaf, Anne Krejbjerg","Møller, Margrethe","Klitbo, Ditte Marie","Nøhr, Susanne","Pedersen, Klaus Michael","Laurberg, Peter"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-102744"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"iodine status in danish pregnant and breastfeeding women including studies of some challenges in urinary iodine status evaluation","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"djr","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-102744","identifier":[{"id":"25535149","type":"pmid"},{"id":"WOS:000356192400044","type":"wos"},{"id":"84929656253","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-b57bd9a8-c58b-437a-9750-836222710a15"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-6B237A1AE3B46086D1C49650A8D081E5"],"oai":{"class":"Unused","mra":["Medicine (MED)"],"yearPub":"2015","yearSub":"2015"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Medicine","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Medicine, Aalborg University Hospital","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Medicine, Aalborg University Hospital, Department of Clinical Biochemistry","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Medicine, Aalborg University Hospital, Hormon- og Stofskiftesygdomme (Endokrinologi) [Klinik Medicin]","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Medicine, Aalborg University Hospital, Klinik Diagnostik","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Medicine, Aalborg University Hospital, Klinik Medicin","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Medicine, Department of Clinical Medicine"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Stine Linding","key":"andersenpau","last":"Andersen","locid":"a08245c4-86df-48d4-b485-d0fee481d01e","name":"Andersen, Stine Linding","orcid":"0000-0001-6336-1936","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Louise Kolding","key":"sørensenpau","last":"Sørensen","locid":"2b4fc7ee-a12d-41b0-b0b0-9f70a0bb33f8","name":"Sørensen, Louise Kolding","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Anne Krejbjerg","key":"motavafpau","last":"Motavaf","locid":"658d399a-756d-4eb9-aef8-831b9039bc03","name":"Motavaf, Anne Krejbjerg","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Margrethe","key":"møllerpau","last":"Møller","locid":"7a88b046-f179-4fcd-971f-d9e404c90679","name":"Møller, Margrethe","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Ditte Marie","key":"klitbopau","last":"Klitbo","name":"Klit