{"abstract":"At present plasma tissue inhibitor of metalloproteinases-1 (TIMP-1) is undergoing validation as a biological marker in colorectal cancer (CRC). The clinical implementation of plasma TIMP-1 in prognosis, prediction, screening and monitoring CRC requires robust information as to the influence of preanalytical factors, including inter- and intrapersonal biological variations. The aim of the present study was to evaluate the possible effects of smoking on the level of TIMP-1 in plasma from healthy subjects.","author_count":6,"contributors":["Rasmussen, Louise","Ladelund, Steen","Brünner, Nils","Jørgensen, Lars Nannestad","Nielsen, Hans Jørgen","Sørensen, Lars Tue"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-696156"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-U"],"level3":{"HO":["DI-HO-ALL","DI-HO-CAP"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-HO-CAP","DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"tissue inhibitor of metalloproteinases 000000000001 as a biological marker in colorectal cancer influence of smoking on plasma levels","src":["ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-696156","identifier":[{"id":"23592002","type":"pmid"},{"id":"84879738206","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["ku-9ca4c150-e513-47e1-908f-b2374c6083d1"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-A18C421F6B2B622B61EB38861385D2A6"],"oai":{"class":"Blocked","mra":["Medicine (MED)"],"yearPub":"2013","yearSub":"2013"},"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"dk","key":"capital region of denmark","l2":"DI-HO","l2n":"Hospitals","l3":"DI-HO-CAP","l3nl":"Capital Region of Denmark","l3nn":"Capital Region of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Capital Region of Denmark","namevar":["Copenhagen University Hospital - Amager and Hvidovre"],"nora_code":"DI-HO-CAP","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Health and Medical Sciences, Department of Clinical Medicine"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","first":"Louise","key":"rasmussenpau","last":"Rasmussen","name":"Rasmussen, Louise","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","first":"Steen","key":"ladelundpau","last":"Ladelund","locid":"351094b7-4fcb-4c1b-aae0-f46f91daefb4","name":"Ladelund, Steen","orcid":"0000-0001-5695-8419","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","first":"Nils Aage","key":"brünnerpau","last":"Brünner","locid":"0e935a59-f9ff-4d0d-8c60-8a74a558e6aa","name":"Brünner, Nils","name_org":"Brünner, Nils Aage","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","first":"Lars N","key":"jørgensenpau","last":"Jørgensen","locid":"ae2a79a1-5374-4e92-84c9-3af55ef5712e","name":"Jørgensen, Lars Nannestad","name_org":"Jørgensen, Lars N","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","first":"Hans Jørgen","key":"nielsenpau","last":"Nielsen","locid":"87f9baf4-e29c-4104-be23-daf6d94d7124","name":"Nielsen, Hans Jørgen","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Lars T","key":"sørensenpau","last":"Sørensen","locid":"0a5b4403-2e6f-437b-a477-98d38aecaae0","name":"Sørensen, Lars Tue","name_org":"Sørensen, Lars T","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["23592002"],"pub":{"doi":"10.5301/jbm.5000017","issn":["03936155","17246008"],"issn_org":["03936155"],"issue":"2","journal":"International Journal of Biological Markers","pages":"226-230","status":"p","title":"International Journal of Biological Markers","volume":"28"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-84879738206"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Hospitals","All Universities","Capital Region of Denmark","DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-HO-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Hospitals","Universities","University of Copenhagen"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ku-9ca4c150-e513-47e1-908f-b2374c6083d1"],"src":["KU University of Copenhagen"],"title":"Tissue inhibitor of metalloproteinases-1 as a biological marker in colorectal cancer : influence of smoking on plasma levels?","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-696156","year":"2013","yearsub":"2013"}
{"abstract":"OBJECTIVE: The quality-adjusted life-year (QALY) is used to measure outcome in rheumatoid arthritis (RA) studies; identification of drivers of a gain in QALY might help predict a treatment response. We investigated how changes in components of the Disease Activity Score-28 joints (DAS28) were associated with the European League Against Rheumatism (EULAR) and European Quality of Life 5 Dimensions (EQ-5D) responses; and what baseline variables predicted the change in QALY following 1 year of biological therapy. METHODS: Data were collected at baseline and after 3, 6, and 12 months of biological therapy in Danish patients with RA and included bDAS28, sociodemographic data, comorbidity, Health Assessment Questionnaire (HAQ), and EQ-5D scored using the Danish algorithm. A cross-tabulation based on EULAR versus EQ-5D responses was performed, and the association of each DAS28 component across the EULAR/EQ-5D response groups was tested. Predictors of a change in QALY were assessed in a multiple regression model including baseline clinical and patient-reported data as explanatory variables. RESULTS: In total, 315 patients entered the study; 77% were women, 78% IgM rheumatoid factor-positive, with mean age 55 (SD 13) years, disease duration 10 (SD 8) years, mean DAS28 4.9 (SD 1.2), HAQ score 1.22 (SD 0.70), and EQ-5D score 0.60 (SD 0.19). Sixty-eight percent of patients gained QALY; the mean gain was 0.14 (SD 0.13). The patient global score was strongly correlated with both EULAR and EQ-5D responses. The gain in QALY increased with increasing patient global score and number of swollen joints, but not with C-reactive protein (CRP). CONCLUSION: The subjective patient global score was the best baseline predictor of gain in QALY following biological therapy, while the objective CRP measure had no predictive value. It seems that no sharp demarcation between objective and subjective measures could be determined.","author_count":4,"contributors":["Linde, Louise","Sørensen, Jan","Østergaard, Mikkel","Hetland, Merete Lund"],"cuid":["S02-083.02-047452"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"keyword":["Adult","Aged","Arthritis Rheumatoid drug therapy","Cost Benefit Analysis","Female","Humans","Male","Middle Aged","Prospective Studies","Quality Adjusted Life Years","Quality of Life","Registries","Remission Induction methods","Severity of Illness Index","Surveys and Questionnaires","Treatment Outcome"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"gain in quality adjusted life years in patients with rheumatoid arthritis during 000000000001 year of biological therapy a prospective study in clinical practice","src":["ku","sdu"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.3899/jrheum.121387","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S02-083.02-047452","identifier":[{"id":"23818719","type":"pmid"},{"id":"84883319867","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["ku-f67155b0-102e-4c3f-9516-bd1b7e12e347","sdu-a772e0ff-2e20-459e-9624-c28d7194c3e9"],"keyword":["Adult","Aged","Antirheumatic Agents/economics","Arthritis, Rheumatoid/drug therapy","Biological Products/economics","Cost-Benefit Analysis","Female","Humans","Male","Middle Aged","Prospective Studies","Quality of Life","Quality-Adjusted Life Years","Registries","Remission Induction/methods","Severity of Illness Index","Surveys and Questionnaires","Treatment Outcome"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-5-6C5DE3D65276A138B82C0F7E760D3D00"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.3899/jrheum.121387","version":"Other Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Blocked","mra":["Medicine (MED)"],"yearPub":"2013","yearSub":"2013"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"sdu university of southern denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-SDU","l3nl":"University of Southern Denmark","l3nn":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","namevar":["SDU, The Faculty of Health Sciences, Department of Public Health, Centre for Applied Health Services Research"],"nora_code":"DI-U-SDU","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Health and Medical Sciences, Department of Clinical Medicine, Department of Clinical Medicine"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jan","key":"sørensenpau","last":"Sørensen","locid":"239cd9bd-c49f-497e-9e4c-5fc8275d360b","name":"Sørensen, Jan","orcid":"0000-0003-0857-9267","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Louise","key":"lindepau","last":"Linde","locid":"fb2816c2-9e87-4e2b-b8fe-7402fe1d31ad","name":"Linde, Louise","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","first":"Mikkel","key":"østergaardpau","last":"Østergaard","locid":"eb9b28bb-2658-4302-8342-2a662ef39d0c","name":"Østergaard, Mikkel","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","first":"Merete Lund","key":"hetlandpau","last":"Hetland","locid":"3407b4a7-174d-43db-bae6-74e7f035a81f","name":"Hetland, Merete Lund","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["23818719"],"pub":{"doi":"10.3899/jrheum.121387","issn":["0315162X","14992752"],"issn_org":["0315162X"],"issue":"9","journal":"The Journal of Rheumatology","pages":"1479-1486","publisher":"Journal of Rheumatology","status":"p","title":"The Journal of Rheumatology","volume":"40"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-84883319867"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities","University of Copenhagen","University of Southern Denmark"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ku-f67155b0-102e-4c3f-9516-bd1b7e12e347","sdu-a772e0ff-2e20-459e-9624-c28d7194c3e9"],"src":["KU University of Copenhagen","SDU University of Southern Denmark"],"title":"Gain in Quality-adjusted Life-years in Patients with Rheumatoid Arthritis During 1 Year of Biological Therapy : A Prospective Study in Clinical Practice","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S02-083.02-047452","year":"2013","yearsub":2014}
{"abstract":"CryoSat data over the Greenland Ice Sheet are used to continue elevation height change data over the Greenland ice sheet, following a decade of detailed monitoring of ice sheet changes with GRACE and IceSat. The combination and validation of the different data for measuring changes is quantified by using available airborne lidar data from IceBridge and CryoVEx. There is a special challenge of using CryoSat as fill-in between EnviSat and Sentinel-3 for the longterm measurements of surface elevation changes, a key essential climate variable in the ESA Climate Change Initiative. Another challenge is the joint utilization of both altimetry and gravity field change measurements for consistent estimates of regional change patterns. In the paper we analyze GRACE, IceSat and CryoSat data since 2003, and present consistent estimates of overall mass changes with average values around -220 GT/year, showing large variations from year to year, with 2012 being another record melt year for the Greenland ice sheet. Sources of the changes are mainly melt of the marginal ice zones in SE and NW Greenland, as well as changes in the major outlet glaciers.","author_count":4,"contributors":["Forsberg, René","Sørensen, Louise Sandberg","Fredenslund Levinsen, Joanna","Nilsson, Johan"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-308959"],"event":{"end":"2013-03-14","place":"Dresden, de","start":"2013-03-12","title":"CryoSat Third User Workshop","year":"2013"},"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-DTU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"mass loss of greenland from grace icesat and cryosat","src":["dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-308959","ids":["dtu-0e88b955-a7ce-4ae1-9b0a-b5186e294d60"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-C7B28BB1B8D1A1711B2E677FC6BAC238"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark, National Space Institute","Technical University of Denmark, National Space Institute, Geodynamics"],"nora_code":"DI-U-DTU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"René","key":"forsbergpau","last":"Forsberg","locid":"be93c88f-cc39-43d8-bf6f-ff4787c55c23","name":"Forsberg, René","orcid":"0000-0002-7288-9545","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Louise Sandberg","key":"sørensenpau","last":"Sørensen","locid":"1c6cb90f-da30-48a2-872f-a94b8100749b","name":"Sørensen, Louise Sandberg","orcid":"0000-0002-3771-4061","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Joanna","key":"fredenslundlevinsenpau","last":"Fredenslund Levinsen","locid":"55f307d3-198e-4dd1-9f7f-2305c650f50d","name":"Fredenslund Levinsen, Joanna","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Johan","key":"nilssonpau","last":"Nilsson","locid":"65e62cc4-51ed-4231-8c7d-415bfcbefbab","name":"Nilsson, Johan","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"place":"Dresden","publisher":"European Space Agency","status":"p","title":"Proceedings of the CryoSat Workshop"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","sdg":["13. Climate Action","All UN SDG Classification"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Technical University of Denmark","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["dtu-0e88b955-a7ce-4ae1-9b0a-b5186e294d60"],"src":["DTU Technical University of Denmark"],"title":"Mass loss of Greenland from GRACE, IceSat and CryoSat","ty