{"abstract":"Maternal iodine requirements increase during pregnancy. Studies performed before the introduction of mandatory iodine fortification of salt in Denmark in 2000 showed that pregnant women with no intake of iodine-containing supplements were moderately iodine-deficient and showed signs of thyroidal stress. We investigated the intake of iodine-containing supplements and urinary iodine excretion in Danish pregnant women after the introduction of iodine fortification of salt.","author_count":5,"contributors":["Andersen, Stine Linding","Sørensen, Louise Kolding","Motavaf, Anne Krejbjerg","Møller, Margrethe","Laurberg, Peter"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-089128"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"iodine deficiency in danish pregnant women","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-089128","identifier":[{"id":"84894627181","type":"scopus"},{"id":"23809968","type":"pmid"}],"ids":["aau-863c6a4b-604d-4e3b-8bcd-bb32b3fa4363"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Local-1-1-C867157E0B9D02089792B19C52955310"],"oai":{"class":"Blocked","mra":["Medicine (MED)"],"yearPub":"2013","yearSub":"2013"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Medicine","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Medicine, Aalborg University Hospital","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Medicine, Aalborg University Hospital, Hormon- og Stofskiftesygdomme (Endokrinologi) [Klinik Medicin]","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Medicine, Aalborg University Hospital, Klinik Medicin"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Stine Linding","key":"andersenpau","last":"Andersen","locid":"a08245c4-86df-48d4-b485-d0fee481d01e","name":"Andersen, Stine Linding","orcid":"0000-0001-6336-1936","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Louise Kolding","key":"sørensenpau","last":"Sørensen","locid":"2b4fc7ee-a12d-41b0-b0b0-9f70a0bb33f8","name":"Sørensen, Louise Kolding","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Anne Krejbjerg","key":"motavafpau","last":"Motavaf","locid":"658d399a-756d-4eb9-aef8-831b9039bc03","name":"Motavaf, Anne Krejbjerg","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Margrethe","key":"møllerpau","last":"Møller","locid":"7a88b046-f179-4fcd-971f-d9e404c90679","name":"Møller, Margrethe","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Peter","key":"laurbergpau","last":"Laurberg","locid":"c4ea92ce-c22d-4543-97c3-e7a2b9a99a53","name":"Laurberg, Peter","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["23809968"],"pub":{"issn":["09078916","22451919"],"issn_org":["16039629"],"issue":"7","journal":"Danish Medical Journal","publisher":"Almindelige Danske Laegeforening","status":"p","title":"Danish Medical Journal","title_org":"Danish Medical Bulletin (Online)","volume":"60"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-863c6a4b-604d-4e3b-8bcd-bb32b3fa4363"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University"],"title":"Iodine deficiency in Danish pregnant women","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-089128","year":"2013","yearsub":"2013"}
{"author_count":6,"contributors":["Holland-Bill, Louise","Christiansen, Christian","Ring, Troels","Sørensen, Henrik Toft","Jørgensen, Jens Otto Lunde"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-116291"],"event":{"end":"2013-05-01","place":"København, dk","start":"2013-04-27","title":"European Congress of Endocrinology","year":"2013"},"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"thirty day mortality in acute non surgical patients admitted with hyponatremia","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dca","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"http://www.endocrine-abstracts.org/ea/0032/ECE2013AbstractBook.pdf","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-116291","ids":["aau-e3e0f2cf-7b10-4b8c-9eeb-55f03b0c2ab3"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Local-1-1-F7EE9B5B43781439452DFC63BBCB3121"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"http://www.endocrine-abstracts.org/ea/0032/ECE2013AbstractBook.pdf","version":"Other Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Medicine","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Medicine, Aalborg University Hospital","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Medicine, Aalborg University Hospital, Klinik Medicin","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Medicine, Aalborg University Hospital, Nyremedicin (Nefrologi) [Klinik Medicin]"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Louise","key":"hollandbillpau","last":"Holland-Bill","name":"Holland-Bill, Louise","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Christian","key":"christiansenpau","last":"Christiansen","name":"Christiansen, Christian","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Troels","key":"ringpau","last":"Ring","locid":"6efec618-81ab-4b8d-a0b0-21545f7c9336","name":"Ring, Troels","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Henrik Toft","key":"sørensenpau","last":"Sørensen","name":"Sørensen, Henrik Toft","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Jens Otto Lunde","key":"jørgensenpau","last":"Jørgensen","name":"Jørgensen, Jens Otto Lunde","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Justo","key":"castañopedh","last":"Castaño","name":"Castaño, Justo","rank":6,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"}],"pub":{"publisher":"Bioscientifica","status":"p","title":"Endocrine Abstracts","volume":"32"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-e3e0f2cf-7b10-4b8c-9eeb-55f03b0c2ab3"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University"],"title":"Thirty-day mortality in acute non-surgical patients admitted with hyponatremia","type":"Conference Abstract","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-116291","year":"2013","yearsub":"2013"}
{"abstract":"Twelve heifers were assigned to either a control diet (CON) with 26 g fat per kg dry matter (DM) or a supplemented diet (FAT) with crushed rapeseed with 53 g fat per kg DM. Methane (CH4) emission was measured by open-circuit indirect calorimetry for four days when the heifers weighed approximately 300 kg. Dry matter intake (DMI; P=0.01) and daily CH4 emission (P=0.002) were lowest on the FAT. However, CH4 emission per kg DMI (P=0.21) or per kg weight gain (P=0.44) was not different. The loss of CH4 as a percentage of gross energy intake tended to be lower on FAT (6.4%) than on CON (6.8%; P=0.08). It is concluded that the FAT may have potential to reduce CH4 emission from heifers, but further studies are warranted to document this effect.","author_count":5,"contributors":["Hellwing, Anne Louise Frydendahl","Sørensen, Martin Tang","Weisbjerg, Martin Riis","Vestergaard, Mogens","Lund, Peter"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-133835"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Cattle","Fat supplementation","Indirect calorimetry"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"can rapeseed lower methane emission from heifers","src":["au"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1080/09064702.2013.788203","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-133835","identifier":[{"id":"84879651688","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["au-07ee86dc-b203-4ef4-ad53-129f4336d6c3"],"keyword":["cattle","fat supplementation","indirect calorimetry"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-1C3031CADA007F71695DFE322533D0FF"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1080/09064702.2013.788203","version":"Other Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Unused","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2013","yearSub":"2013"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Technical Sciences, Department of Animal and Veterinary Sciences, Department of Animal and Veterinary Sciences - ANIS Nutrition"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Anne Louise Frydendahl","key":"hellwingpau","last":"Hellwing","locid":"ad65c0e8-8a1c-4f17-bb65-80aec2189e32","name":"Hellwing, Anne Louise Frydendahl","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Martin Tang","key":"sørensenpau","last":"Sørensen","locid":"fefc1862-587c-4b1f-9e20-694246b18221","name":"Sørensen, Martin Tang","orcid":"0000-0002-0523-4282","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Martin Riis","key":"weisbjergpau","last":"Weisbjerg","locid":"501c877c-de2b-4cd2-9f3c-42e223238a40","name":"Weisbjerg, Martin Riis","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Mogens","key":"vestergaardpau","last":"Vestergaard","locid":"f886731d-42d7-485e-b44c-f48981a245e7","name":"Vestergaard, Mogens","orcid":"0000-0002-3630-1396","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Peter","key":"lundpau","last":"Lund","locid":"c933cda2-363e-4cb6-b596-3df7ef3d30ed","name":"Lund, Peter","orcid":"0000-0002-9113-4500","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1080/09064702.2013.788203","issn":["09064702","16511972"],"issn_org":["09064702"],"issue":"4, 2012","journal":"Acta Agriculturae Scandinavica, Section A - Animal Science","pages":"259-262","publisher":"Taylor and Francis Ltd.","status":"p","title":"Acta Agriculturae Scandinavica, Section A - Animal Science","volume":"62"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-84879651688"],"search":{"DAF":["Aarhus University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["au-07ee86dc-b203-4ef4-ad53-129f4336d6c3"],"src":["AU Aarhus University"],"title":"Can rapeseed lower methane emission from heifers?","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-133835","year":"2013","yearsub":"2013"}
{"abstract":"Group G streptococci (GGS) are beta-haemolytic, and can be found as commensal on skin and mucous membranes. Several articles describe an increased incidence of invasive GGS infections, in majority among older men with co-morbidities. We describe a rare case of invasive post-partum infection, most likely nosocomial transmission since the infected patient shared bath and toilet facilities with the index patient for one day during admission. Subtype stG643 was found in both cases.","author_count":4,"contributors":["Jöhnk, Maria Louise","Ingels, Helene Andrea Sinclair","Sørensen, Alice Løvendahl","Lambertsen, Lotte Munch"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-209807"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Adult","Anti Bacterial Agents","Cross Infection","Denmark","Female","Humans","Male","Postpartum Period","Streptococcal Infections","Streptococcus"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-OT","DI-U"],"level3":{"OT":["Unspecified organisation"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"gruppe g streptokokker som sjælden årsag til nosokomiel barselsfeber","src":["au"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"https://www.scopus.com/pages/publications/84875609406","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-209807","identifier":[{"id":"84875609406","type":"scopus"},{"id":"23480889","type":"pmid"}],"ids":["au-8d1cd8fc-dcb8-4fa2-8577-7d53bd969b32"],"keyword":["Adult","Anti-Bacterial Agents","Cross Infection","Denmark","Female","Humans","Male","Postpartum Period","Puerperal Infection","Streptococcal Infections","Streptococcus"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-AEC3FDE43E1C6F8E91E018CB12BE4E07"],"oai":{"class":"Blocked","mra":["Medicine (MED)"],"yearPub":"2013","yearSub":"2014"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Health, Department of Clinical Medicine, Department of Clinical Medicine - Viborg Regional Hospital"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"miscellaneous","l2":"DI-OT","l2n":"Miscellaneous","l3":"DI-OT","l3nl":"Other Research","l3nn":"Miscellaneous","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Miscellaneous","namevar":["Unspecified organisation"],"nora_code":"DI-OT","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Maria Louise","key":"jöhnkpau","last":"Jöhnk","name":"Jöhnk, Maria Louise","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Helene Andrea Sinclair","key":"ingelspau","last":"Ingels","name":"Ingels, Helene Andrea Sinclair","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Alice Løvendahl","key":"sørensenpau","last":"Sørensen","locid":"44f8740d-2af8-4781-9b2d-59f3938327c4","name":"Sørensen, Alice Løvendahl","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Lotte Munch","key":"lambertsenpau","last":"Lambertsen","name":"Lambertsen, Lotte Munch","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["23480889"],"pub":{"issn":["00415782","13994174"],"issn_org":["00415782"],"issue":"11","journal":"Ugeskrift for Læger","pages":"740-1","publisher":"Almindelige Danske Lægeforening","status":"p","title":"Ugeskrift for Læger","volume":"175"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-84875609406"],"search":{"DAF":["Aarhus University","All Danish Affiliations","All Miscellaneous","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-OT","DI-OT-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Miscellaneous","Other Research","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["au-8d1cd8fc-dcb8-4fa2-8577-7d53bd969b32"],"src":["AU Aarhus University"],"title":"Gruppe G-streptokokker som sjælden årsag til nosokomiel barselsfeber","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-209807","year":"2013","yearsub":"2014"}
{"abstract":"Nærværende rapport er udarbejdet af forskere ved Aarhus Universitet på foranledning af NaturErhvervstyrelsen. Rapporten giver en samlet oversigt over miljøteknologier der benyttes inden for det primære jordbrugserhverv, herunder deres miljøeffekt, omkostninger samt omkostningseffektivitet. Rapporten anvendes af Naturerhvervstyrelsen til prioritering af ansøgninger i anledning af Fødevareministeriets miljøteknologiordning omfattende tilskud til projekter vedrørende investeringer i grønne processer og teknologier i den primære jordbrugsproduktion.","author_count":13,"contributors":["Hansen, Michael Jørgen","Nyord, Tavs","Hansen, Line Block","Martinsen, Louise","Hasler, Berit","Jensen, Peter Kryger","Melander, Bo","Thomsen, Anton Gårde","Poulsen, Hanne Damgaard","Lund, Peter","Sørensen, Jørn Nygaard","Ottosen, Carl-Otto","Andersen, Lillie"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-242657"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["T0 2013"],"level":"com","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU"]},"review":"nr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"miljøteknologier i det primære jordbrug driftsøkonomi og miljøeffektivitet","src":["au"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU"],"type":"dr","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-242657","ids":["au-c680d3ca-287a-4afb-b738-d44581275292"],"keyword":["T0-2013"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Commissioned","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-7E142FF48BA4BEC9B53005C36ACC2CC1"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Technical Sciences, Department of Engineering, Department of Engineering - Air Quality Engineering, Finlandsgade 10"],"nora_code