{"abstract":"We present experiments and theory for flows of sugar or salt solutions in cylindrical tubes with semipermeable walls (hollow fiber membranes) immersed in water, quantifying the strength of the osmotic driving force in relation to the dimensionless parameters that specify the system. The pumping efficiency of these flows is limited by the presence of “unstirred” concentration boundary layers near the tube walls, and our primary aim is to understand and quantify these layers and their effect on the flow. We measure the outlet flow rate Qout while varying the inlet flow rate Q*, concentration c*, and tube length L, and map out the dependence of the flow rate gain γ=Qout/Q*-1 on these parameters. A theoretical analysis based on (1) the known velocity field for slow flow in cylindrical porous tubes and (2) a parabolic concentration profile allows us to compute analytically how the flow gain depends on the relative magnitude of radial diffusion and advection as well as the ratio of the osmotic velocity to pumping velocity, in very good agreement with experiments and with no adjustable parameters. Our analysis provides criteria that are useful for optimizing osmotic flow processes in, e.g., water purification devices.","author_count":5,"contributors":["Haaning, Louise Sejling","Jensen, Kaare Hartvig","Hélix-Nielsen, Claus","Berg-Sørensen, Kirstine","Bohr, Tomas"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-307336"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-DTU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"efficiency of osmotic pipe flows","src":["dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/55502312/PhysRevE.87.053019.pdf","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-307336","identifier":[{"id":"23767632","type":"pmid"},{"id":"84878512801","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["dtu-0924eda7-ac5e-472e-99c3-c9308c8b6656"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-391C58508613F57C3E005DC46DEC7A7D"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1103/PhysRevE.87.053019","version":"Other Version"},{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/55502312/PhysRevE.87.053019.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2013","yearSub":"2013"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark, Department of Physics"],"nora_code":"DI-U-DTU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Louise Sejling","key":"haaningpau","last":"Haaning","locid":"446e7a79-6ef8-40f4-81fb-49fb049aab34","name":"Haaning, Louise Sejling","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Kaare Hartvig","key":"jensenpau","last":"Jensen","locid":"c5e52e6d-6152-4d19-9e38-f344cc56a318","name":"Jensen, Kaare Hartvig","orcid":"0000-0003-0787-5283","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Claus","key":"helixnielsenpau","last":"Helix Nielsen","locid":"bea497c9-caba-420a-81f8-8f2730634b31","name":"Hélix-Nielsen, Claus","name_org":"Helix Nielsen, Claus","orcid":"0000-0002-9392-7133","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Kirstine","key":"bergsørensenpau","last":"Berg-Sørensen","locid":"f1c10c27-0fce-408f-88a4-b6262dcb8e98","name":"Berg-Sørensen, Kirstine","orcid":"0000-0002-9977-3980","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Tomas","key":"bohrpau","last":"Bohr","locid":"3dc7966f-a677-4017-a2e6-11d0c726d0aa","name":"Bohr, Tomas","orcid":"0000-0003-3620-7276","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["23767632"],"pub":{"doi":"10.1103/physreve.87.053019","issn":["24700045","24700053"],"issn_org":["24700045"],"issue":"5","journal":"Physical Review E","pages":"053019","publisher":"American Physical Society","status":"p","title":"Physical Review E","volume":"87"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-84878512801"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Technical University of Denmark","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["dtu-0924eda7-ac5e-472e-99c3-c9308c8b6656"],"src":["DTU Technical University of Denmark"],"title":"Efficiency of osmotic pipe flows","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-307336","year":"2013","yearsub":"2013"}
{"abstract":"Aims: In patients with stable coronary artery disease (CAD) and refractory angina we performed direct intra-myocardial injections of autologous mesenchymal stromal cells (MSCs) and followed the safety and efficacy of the treatment for 12 months. Methods and Results: A total of 31 patients with stable CAD, moderate to severe angina, normal left ventricular ejection fraction and no further revascularization options, were included. Bone marrow MSCs were isolated and culture expanded for 6 - 8 weeks and then stimulated with vascular endothelial growth factor (VEGF) for one week.The 12 months follow-up demonstrated, that it was safe to culture expand MSCs and use the cells for clinical treatment. The patients maximal metabolic equivalent (MET) during exercise increased from 4.23 MET at baseline to 4.72 MET at 12 months follow-up (p","author_count":8,"contributors":["Haack-Sørensen, Mandana","Friis, Tina","Mathiasen, Anders B","Jørgensen, Erik","Hansen, Louise","Dickmeiss, Ebbe","Ekblond, Annette","Kastrup, Jens"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-479848"],"filters":{"added":"2022-04","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"direct intramyocardial mesenchymal stromal cell injections in patients with severe refractory angina one year follow up","src":["ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.3727/096368912X636830","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-479848","identifier":[{"id":"84877591863","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["ku-90a48c56-1920-4003-93e9-3e42b32eb837"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-E1A4194B9C8406A2EACCB1DD2A1E769C"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.3727/096368912X636830","version":"Other Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Unused","mra":["Medicine (MED)"],"yearPub":"2013","yearSub":"2013"},"org":[{"affno":1,"key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Health and Medical Sciences, Department of Clinical Medicine, Section of Surgery and Internal Medicine"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU"}],"person":[{"affno":"","first":"Mandana","key":"haacksørensenpau","last":"Haack-Sørensen","name":"Haack-Sørensen, Mandana","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Tina","key":"friispau","last":"Friis","name":"Friis, Tina","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Anders B","key":"mathiasenpau","last":"Mathiasen","name":"Mathiasen, Anders B","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Erik","key":"jørgensenpau","last":"Jørgensen","name":"Jørgensen, Erik","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Louise","key":"hansenpau","last":"Hansen","name":"Hansen, Louise","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Ebbe","key":"dickmeisspau","last":"Dickmeiss","locid":"3737db7a-dba7-4e16-ba6d-73a840ceb9c6","name":"Dickmeiss, Ebbe","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Annette","key":"ekblondpau","last":"Ekblond","name":"Ekblond, Annette","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Jens","key":"kastruppau","last":"Kastrup","locid":"12c1241f-23da-492c-84b0-36691cb95255","name":"Kastrup, Jens","rank":8,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.3727/096368912x636830","issn":["09636897","15553892"],"issn_org":["09636897"],"issue":"3","journal":"Cell Transplantation","pages":"521-8","status":"p","title":"Cell Transplantation","volume":"22"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-84877591863"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","