","last":"Young","name":"Young, Duncan","rank":46,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"H Jay","key":"zwallypau","last":"Zwally","name":"Zwally, H Jay","rank":47,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1126/science.1228102","issn":["00368075","10959203"],"issn_org":["00368075"],"issue":"6111","journal":"Science","pages":"1183-1189","publisher":"American Association for the Advancement of Science","status":"p","title":"Science","volume":"338"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-84870202275"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Technical University of Denmark","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["dtu-93d9369e-ee23-4aea-ad92-4d0c7a7b181e"],"src":["DTU Technical University of Denmark"],"title":"A reconciled estimate of ice-sheet mass balance.","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-348687","year":"2012","yearsub":"2012"}
{"abstract":"We present mass change time series at basin scale for both Greenland and Antarctica, de-rived from GRACE data, and use these data to find the associated global sea level changes. We use two independent methods for GRACE ice mass loss estimation, including use of different GIA models and estimation of appropriate error bars. The first method applied is based on a mass in-version, while the second one uses integration over a representation given in water equivalent. We find good agreement between the resulting mass changes based on the two independent methods, especially in the behavior of time series. We also compare our GRACE derived regional estimates with independent mass change results based on altimetry data from NASA’s Ice Cloud and land Elevation Satellite. From the estimated Greenland and Antarctica mass changes we compute the gravitationally self-consistent sea-level changes and its associated uncertainties, and show results of the impact of Earth model uncertainties in the global sea level change and its regional “fingerprints”.","author_count":3,"contributors":["Barletta, Valentina Roberta","Sørensen, Louise Sandberg","Forsberg, René"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-373663"],"event":{"end":"2012-03-22","place":"Athens, gr","start":"2012-03-19","title":"SLALOM 2012","year":"2012"},"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Ice mass balance"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-DTU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"sea level changes from monthly solutions of ice sheet mass balance","src":["dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU"],"type":"dca","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/9770448/Barletta-IceMass-SLALOM_rf.pdf","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-373663","ids":["dtu-e7213b92-d7ed-45da-8883-41161041489d"],"keyword":["Globe sea level rise","Ice mass balance"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-83ACE66936501C4B0C6EBA38DA0B619A"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/9770448/Barletta-IceMass-SLALOM_rf.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark, National Space Institute","Technical University of Denmark, National Space Institute, Geodynamics"],"nora_code":"DI-U-DTU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Valentina Roberta","key":"barlettapau","last":"Barletta","locid":"9662b7b8-5901-45b2-bba3-dd8e3879f864","name":"Barletta, Valentina Roberta","orcid":"0000-0003-4427-0830","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Louise Sandberg","key":"sørensenpau","last":"Sørensen","locid":"1c6cb90f-da30-48a2-872f-a94b8100749b","name":"Sørensen, Louise Sandberg","orcid":"0000-0002-3771-4061","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"René","key":"forsbergpau","last":"Forsberg","locid":"be93c88f-cc39-43d8-bf6f-ff4787c55c23","name":"Forsberg, René","orcid":"0000-0002-7288-9545","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"status":"p"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Technical University of Denmark","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["dtu-e7213b92-d7ed-45da-8883-41161041489d"],"src":["DTU Technical University of Denmark"],"title":"Sea level changes from monthly solutions of ice sheet mass balance","type":"Conference Abstract","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/searc