{"abstract":"The fusarielins are a group of metabolites found in several Aspergillus and Fusarium species that have been reported to have with weak antifungal, antibiotic and cytotoxic effects. This study identifies fusarielin A, F, G and H isolated from Fusarium as mycoestrogens. Mycoestrogens are compounds from fungi that bind to the estrogen receptors and induce an estrogenic response in targeted cells. All four tested fusarielins stimulate MCF-7 cell proliferation with fusarielin H as the most potent, able to stimulate cell proliferation 4-fold in a resazurin metabolism assay at 25 μM. MDA-MB-231 cells without the estrogen receptor-α and MCF-10a cells without estrogen receptors were not stimulated by fusarielins. Furthermore, the stimulation was prevented in MCF-7 cells when fusarielins were incubated in the presence of the estrogen receptor antagonist fulvestrant. These observations suggest that fusarielins bind to the estrogen receptor and act as weak mycoestrogens.","author_count":7,"contributors":["Sondergaard, Teis Esben","G. Klitgaard, Louise","Purup, Stig","Kobayashic, Hisayoshi","Giese, Henriette","Sørensen, Jens Laurids"],"cuid":["S02-094.23-008310"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"continent":["Asia, East","OECD"],"country":["Japan"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","The University of Tokyo","University of Tokyo"],"keyword":["Breast cancer","Estrogen","Estrogen receptor","Fusarium","MCF 7","Mycoestrogen","Secondary metabolites"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-AU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"estrogenic effects of fusarielins in human breast cancer cell lines","src":["aau","au"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-AU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.toxlet.2012.09.004","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S02-094.23-008310","identifier":[{"id":"22982765","type":"pmid"},{"id":"WOS:000310534100004","type":"wos"},{"id":"84867137098","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-ac764c08-8619-43aa-8e1b-b9118185d483","au-7c508820-f3fb-41c5-b17d-fa366cf431b9"],"keyword":["Breast cancer","Estrogen","Estrogen receptor","Fusarium","MCF-7","Mycoestrogen","Secondary metabolites"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-5-65FBD3C2DEF6795EC487C77390AF462C"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.toxlet.2012.09.004","version":"Other Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science (ENG)","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, Department of Chemistry and Bioscience","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, Department of Chemistry and Bioscience, Section of Biotechnology"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Aarhus University, Faculty of Agricultural Sciences, Immunology and microbiology"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"jp","key":"the university of tokyo","loc":["Japan","Asia, East","OECD"],"name":"The University of Tokyo","used":1},{"affno":"4","country":"jp","key":"university of tokyo","loc":["Japan","Asia, East","OECD"],"name":"University of Tokyo","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1 2","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Teis","key":"søndergaardpau","last":"Søndergaard","locid":"c4550265-7489-4e7e-a723-b7cfef89912e","name":"Sondergaard, Teis Esben","name_org":"Søndergaard, Teis","orcid":"0000-0002-4455-7498","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Louise Graabæk","key":"klitgaardpau","last":"Klitgaard","locid":"8bc59936-f41f-4413-bd49-452a0673b63c","name":"Klitgaard, Louise Graabæk","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Stig","key":"puruppau","last":"Purup","locid":"15364c45-627d-42e1-8c30-97388f6de572","name":"Purup, Stig","orcid":"0000-0003-0653-4751","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","corresponding":null,"first":"Hisayoshi","key":"kobayashicpau","last":"Kobayashic","name":"Kobayashic, Hisayoshi","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"4","corresponding":null,"first":"Hisayoshi","key":"kobayashipau","last":"Kobayashi","name":"Kobayashi, Hisayoshi","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1 2","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Henriette","key":"giesepau","last":"Giese","locid":"16f6c208-b54e-4399-bd9e-7d5a215c3d94","name":"Giese, Henriette","orcid":"0000-0002-5284-4155","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1 2","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jens Laurids","key":"sørensenpau","last":"Sørensen","locid":"365188dd-0cdc-4c71-a590-2ccd261ae3df","name":"Sørensen, Jens Laurids","orcid":"0000-0002-2392-5343","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["22982765"],"pub":{"doi":"10.1016/j.toxlet.2012.09.004","issn":["03784274","18793169"],"issn_org":["03784274"],"issue":"3","journal":"Toxicology Letters","pages":"259-262","publisher":"Elsevier Ireland Ltd","status":"p","title":"Toxicology Letters","volume":"214"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-84867137098"],"search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","Aarhus University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-ac764c08-8619-43aa-8e1b-b9118185d483","au-7c508820-f3fb-41c5-b17d-fa366cf431b9"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University","AU Aarhus University"],"title":"Estrogenic effects of fusarielins in human breast cancer cell lines.","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S02-094.23-008310","year":"2012","yearsub":"2012"}
{"abstract":"Like many other filamentous fungi, Fusarium graminearum has the genetic potential to produce a vast array of unknown secondary metabolites. A promising approach to determine the nature of these is to activate silent secondary metabolite gene clusters through constitutive expression of cluster specific transcription factors. We have developed a system in which an expression cassette containing the transcription factor from the targeted PKS cluster disrupts the production of the red mycelium pigment aurofusarin. This aids with identification of mutants as they appear as white colonies and metabolite analyses where aurofusarin and its intermediates are normally among the most abundant compounds. The system was used for constitutive expression of the local transcription factor from the PKS9 cluster (renamed FSL) leading to production of three novel fusarielins, F, G and H. This group of compounds has not previously been reported from F. graminearum or linked to a biosynthetic gene in any fungal species. The toxicity of the three novel fusarielins was examined against colorectal cancer cell lines where fusarielin H was more potent than fusarielin F and G.","author_count":11,"contributors":["Sørensen, Jens Laurids","Hansen, Frederik Teilfeldt","Sondergaard, Teis Esben","Staerk, Dan","V. Lee, Tet","Wimmer, Reinhard","G. Klitgaard, Louise","Purup, Stig","Giese, Henriette","John Nordmand Frandsen, Rasmus"],"cuid":["S04-094.54-009405"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":4,"continent":["OECD","Oceania"],"country":["New Zealand"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","The University of Auckland","University of Auckland"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-OT","DI-U"],"level3":{"OT":["Sektion for Bioteknologi"],"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU","DI-U-DTU","DI-U-KU","DI-U-UND"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-AU","DI-U-DTU","DI-U-KU","DI-U-UND"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"production of novel fusarielins by ectopic activation of the polyketide synthase 000000000009 cluster in fusarium graminearum","src":["aau","au","dtu","ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-AU","DI-U-DTU","DI-U-KU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1111/j.1462-2920.2011.02696.x","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S04-094.54-009405","identifier":[{"id":"22252016","type":"pmid"},{"id":"84862830250","type":"scopus"},{"id":"WOS:000302934000005","type":"wos"}],"ids":["aau-c391c71a-b22f-4d8e-a053-1c4e36025b80","au-6d16c1da-0871-481f-b262-f77bc1731cf5","dtu-9686f198-2a83-4716-9cd4-fb2dc7aaa78a","ku-3927a935-9bac-46d4-a44e-0f15c8968204"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-7-12B0AF47B2B89FF0CEDC0A5970ADA3E2"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1111/j.1462-2920.2011.02696.x","version":"Other Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science (ENG)","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, Department of Chemistry and Bioscience","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, Department of Chemistry and Bioscience, Section of Biotechnology","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, Department of Chemistry and Bioscience, Section of Chemical Engineering"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus Univ