{"abstract":"Ioniske selvsamlende materialer udgør en klasse af stoffer med høj orden på nanoskala. På et førsteårskursus i nanovidenskab på Københavns Universitet er en serie af disse stoffer undersøgt i samarbejde med ph.d.-stipendiater, der har hjulpet med at udfø-re og tolke de mere avancerede målinger.","author_count":7,"contributors":["Sørensen, Thomas Just","Laursen, Bo Wegge","Jain, Titoo","Thyrhaug, Erling","Wadsäter, Maria Helena","Åkesson, Anna Karin Louise","Kjær, Kasper Skov"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-472915"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-KU"]},"review":"nr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"nye nanomaterialer","src":["ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://curis.ku.dk/ws/files/45775061/TJS_Dansk_Kemi_2011.pdf","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-472915","ids":["ku-84cbd275-6ca5-4b2b-b5d4-14c454967d46"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-C2FCA9FEDF871A0CE66C32ABF8E10FD9"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://curis.ku.dk/ws/files/45775061/TJS_Dansk_Kemi_2011.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Science, Department of Chemistry"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","first":"Thomas Just","key":"sørensenpau","last":"Sørensen","locid":"0744dbfc-1b71-4ed8-8fee-84ddc6005b6b","name":"Sørensen, Thomas Just","orcid":"0000-0003-1491-5116","rank":1,"rolecode":"